  ["City Life: Describe city noise",["a bus card\t\t一张公交卡","different types of housing\t\t不同类型住宅","Why do many white-collar workers like going to the gym after work?\t\t为什么很多白领喜欢下班后去健身房？","The traffic lights were replaced by the transportation department.\t\t交通灯被交通部门给换了。","Today I was woken up by noise again.\t\t今天我又叫噪音吵醒了。","They plan to use modern technology to upgrade the aging bus system.\t\t他们打算利用现代技术改造老旧的公交系统。","They say temperatures will continue to rise this summer.\t\t他们说今年夏天温度会持续上升。","The sidewalk used to be very old, now it looks very tidy.\t\t以前的人行道很老旧，现在看起来很整洁。","housing costs\t\t住宅成本","residential renovation costs\t\t住宅装修费用","Have you ever moved because of poor public safety?\t\t你有没有因为治安不好而搬家过？","Have you noticed that downtown is being redeveloped?\t\t你有没有注意到市中心正在被改造？","Which famous landmarks in Beijing do you know?\t\t你知道北京的哪些著名地标吗？","Do you know why the downtown square is going to be renovated?\t\t你知道市中心广场为什么要改造吗？","Which city do you think is the safest?\t\t你觉得哪个城市的治安最好？","Do you think relaxing in big cities costs more?\t\t你觉得在大城市休闲需要花更多钱吗？","Do you think nightlife is important for city residents?\t\t你觉得夜生活对城市居民来说重要吗？","Do you think nightlife is important for young people?\t\t你觉得夜生活对年轻人来说重要吗？","Do you think the newly built library is modern enough?\t\t你觉得新建的图书馆够现代化吗？","reload the bus card\t\t充值公交卡","the office building's surroundings\t\t写字楼周边环境","office building renovation\t\t写字楼装修","strengthen public security management\t\t加强治安管理","Beijing's housing prices\t\t北京的房价","call a ride-hailing car\t\t叫网约车","Because of rising temperatures, city residents are buying air conditioners in large numbers.\t\t因为气温上升，城市居民纷纷购买空调。","In big cities, many people like to go to the park to relax on weekends.\t\t在大城市，很多人喜欢周末去公园休闲。","urban residential property prices\t\t城市住宅价格","city noise problem\t\t城市噪音问题","city housing prices\t\t城市房价","city landmarks\t\t城市的地标","Everyone was attracted by this mall.\t\t大家都被这个商场给吸引了。","She is very interested in the city's industrial history.\t\t她对城市的工业历史非常感兴趣。","If urban planning is good, life will be more convenient.\t\t如果城市规划得好，生活会更方便。","If the school zoning changes, we will need to make new arrangements for our child's schooling.\t\t如果学区调整了，我们就必须重新安排孩子上学。","If home prices go down, I will consider moving downtown.\t\t如果房价降低，我会考虑搬到市中心。","If the rent keeps going up, will you move?\t\t如果房租继续上升，你会搬家吗？","school district requirements\t\t学区条件","student bus card\t\t学生公交卡","a wide sidewalk\t\t宽阔的人行道","industrial center\t\t工业中心","downtown landmark\t\t市中心地标","Downtown does not have a large industrial district.\t\t市中心没有大型的工业区。","Many white-collar workers work in downtown office buildings.\t\t很多白领都在市中心的写字楼上班。","We moved three times to be in a good school district.\t\t我们家为了进好学区搬了三次家。","We always let stress affect our mood.\t\t我们总是叫压力影响了心情。","I took my friend to visit a famous landmark building.\t\t我带朋友参观了著名的地标建筑。","I believe that a rich nightlife can make a city more vibrant.\t\t我认为丰富的夜生活可以让城市更有活力。","home price differences\t\t房价差异","replace the bus card with a new one\t\t换新公交卡","The government is planning new subway lines.\t\t政府正在规划新的地铁线路。","cultural landmark\t\t文化地标","newly built housing\t\t新建住宅","new industrial project\t\t新的工业项目","The old factory was renovated by the boss.\t\t旧工厂被老板给装修了。","Yesterday I walked on the sidewalk and felt very safe.\t\t昨天我走在人行道上，觉得很安全。","environmental noise standards\t\t环境噪音标准","modern hospital\t\t现代化医院","modern city\t\t现代化城市","modern building\t\t现代化大楼","modernized school\t\t现代化学校","white-collar apartments\t\t白领公寓","online ride-hailing driver\t\t网约车司机","online ride hailing service\t\t网约车服务","online ride-hailing order\t\t网约车订单","The vegetable market was demolished by the government.\t\t菜市场叫政府给拆了。","famous landmarks\t\t著名地标","Although rural housing is inexpensive, transportation is not very convenient.\t\t虽然乡村住宅便宜，但交通不太方便。","buying a home\t\t购买住宅","light rail to subway transfer\t\t轻轨换乘地铁","light rail monthly pass cost\t\t轻轨月票费用","important landmarks\t\t重要地标","reduce traffic noise\t\t降低交通噪音","lower the noise level\t\t降低噪音水平","upscale residential community\t\t高档住宅小区","upscale office building\t\t高档写字楼"]],
  ["Festivals: Plan festival activities",["main sponsor\t\t主要赞助商","They must at least offer New Year greetings.\t\t他们怎么也得拜年。","task assignment\t\t任务分工","traditional firecracker activities\t\t传统的鞭炮活动","Will you toast your friends during the Spring Festival?\t\t你会不会在春节的时候向朋友敬酒？","Would you like to raise a glass with us to the New Year?\t\t你愿意和我们一起敬一杯新年酒吗？","Would you like to sing this Lantern Festival song with us?\t\t你愿意和我们合唱这首元宵节的歌吗？","How do you plan to celebrate the Lantern Festival this year?\t\t你打算今年怎么庆祝元宵节？","Have you ever personally experienced the fun of lion dancing?\t\t你有没有亲自体验过舞狮的乐趣？","Do you know why people think setting off firecrackers is lucky?\t\t你知道为什么人们认为放鞭炮吉利吗？","Do you think it's necessary to toast coworkers?\t\t你觉得向同事敬酒是必要的吗？","Which activities do you think should be arranged for opening day?\t\t你觉得开业当天应该安排哪些活动？","Do you think holiday reunions will make family relationships closer?\t\t你认为节日团聚会让家庭关系更加亲密吗？","Do you still remember how it felt the first time you wore a school uniform?\t\t你还记得第一次穿校服的感受吗？","Do you still remember what you looked like the first time you wore your school uniform?\t\t你还记得第一次穿校服的样子吗？","During the Lantern Festival, I learned to make traditional lanterns.\t\t元宵节期间，我学会了做传统的灯笼。","Lantern Festival lion dance\t\t元宵节舞狮","whole family big cleanup\t\t全家大扫除","participate in the big cleanup\t\t参加大扫除","auspicious gift\t\t吉利的礼物","In the park, people hang all kinds of lanterns on the trees.\t\t在公园里，人们把各种各样的灯笼挂在树上。","After the big cleanup, the house became especially neat and bright.\t\t大扫除以后，家里变得特别整洁明亮。","big cleanup event\t\t大扫除活动","If Mom starts nagging again, how will you respond to her?\t\t如果妈妈又开始唠叨，你会怎么回应她呢？","Mom likes to make dumplings by hand, because she feels this is more festive.\t\t妈妈喜欢亲手包饺子，因为她觉得这样更有节日的气氛。","The children sang as a choir in the park, attracting a large audience.\t\t孩子们在公园里合唱，吸引了很多观众。","The children are singing together in the square, and the atmosphere is very lively.\t\t孩子们在广场上合唱，气氛非常热闹。","deep house cleaning\t\t家庭大扫除","end of the year cleanup\t\t年底大扫除","celebrate the Lantern Festival\t\t庆祝元宵节","After we opened, many customers came to the store to congratulate us.\t\t开业后，很多顾客都来店里祝贺我们。","thank the principal\t\t感谢校长","Whatever we say, we still have to invite all the clients.\t\t我们说什么也得邀请所有客户。","We need to define the division of labor clearly so the preparations will go more smoothly.\t\t我们需要明确分工，这样准备工作会更顺利。","I hope to attract more customers on opening day.\t\t我希望开业当天能够吸引更多顾客。","I must at the very least offer New Year’s greetings to my friends.\t\t我怎么也得给朋友们拜年。","I should at least try writing Spring Festival couplets.\t\t我怎么也得试试写春联。","My family gets up early every Spring Festival to go to our neighbor's home and offer New Year greetings.\t\t我的家人每年春节都会早起去邻居家拜年。","I think wearing red clothes for the New Year is very lucky.\t\t我觉得新年穿红色衣服非常吉利。","No matter what, I have to invite all of my friends.\t\t我说什么也得邀请所有的朋友。","handwritten red packet cover\t\t手写红包封面","handwritten greeting card\t\t手写贺卡","clear division of labor\t\t明确分工","Chinese New Year deep cleaning\t\t春节大扫除","Yesterday we held a meeting and discussed each person's assignments.\t\t昨天我们开会讨论了每个人的分工。","The principal delivered a moving speech at the graduation ceremony.\t\t校长在毕业典礼上发表了感人的演讲。","The principal invited outstanding students to share their learning experiences.\t\t校长请优秀学生分享他们的学习经验。","I feel especially warm at every holiday gathering.\t\t每次节日团聚，我都觉得特别温暖。","Dad's homemade New Year's Eve dinner warms my heart.\t\t爸爸亲手做的年夜饭让我觉得很温暖。","watch a lion dance event\t\t看舞狮活动","rent audio equipment\t\t租用音响设备","paper lantern\t\t纸灯笼","perform the lion dance to celebrate festivals\t\t舞狮庆祝节日","lively lion dance scene\t\t舞狮热闹现场","Although Grandma often nags, I know she does it for our good.\t\t虽然奶奶经常唠叨，但我知道她是为了我们好。","detailed division of labor\t\t详细分工","adjust sound system volume\t\t调整音响音量","cooperation with sponsors\t\t赞助商合作","the sound system volume is high\t\t音响音量大","the vacation after the National College Entrance Examination\t\t高考后的假期","a meal together after the college entrance exam\t\t高考后的聚餐"]],
  ["Travel: Compare cruise cabins",["world cultural heritage\t\t世界文化遗产","enjoy hot springs\t\t享受温泉","introducing cultural heritage\t\t介绍文化遗产","traditional cultural heritage\t\t传统文化遗产","Are you interested in touring Xi'an together?\t\t你有没有兴趣一起去西安观光？","Have you ever heard of Zhangjiajie's beautiful scenery?\t\t你有没有听说过张家界的美丽风景？","Do you feel especially excited after you board the plane?\t\t你登机以后是不是觉得特别兴奋？","Do you know which hotel is near the hot spring?\t\t你知道哪个酒店靠近温泉吗？","Do you know which Asian countries offer visa-free entry to Chinese citizens?\t\t你知道哪些亚洲国家对中国免签吗？","Do you know which Asian countries grant us visa-free entry?\t\t你知道哪些亚洲国家对我们免签吗？","It is easy to use, just not very flexible.\t\t使用方便是方便，就是不太灵活。","It is easy to use, but the volume is too low.\t\t使用方便是方便，就是音量太小。","the information is boring\t\t信息枯燥","remote guesthouse\t\t偏远的民宿","free audio guide\t\t免费语音导览","upgrade to a sea view room\t\t升级海景房","visit Zhangjiajie\t\t参观张家界","visit cultural heritage\t\t参观文化遗产","ocean view double room\t\t双人海景房","travel first class\t\t坐头等舱","king room with breakfast included\t\t大床房含早餐","first class lounge\t\t头等舱休息室","wonderful scenery\t\t奇妙的景色","wonderful scenery\t\t奇妙的风景","If you like a spacious room, I suggest choosing a king room.\t\t如果你喜欢空间宽敞，我建议选大床房。","If you come to Beijing, I will definitely take you sightseeing.\t\t如果你来北京，我一定陪你去观光。","If you did not bring your passport, you will not be able to board.\t\t如果你没带护照，就不能顺利登机。","If you choose an ocean-view room, you can enjoy the ocean anytime.\t\t如果你选择海景房，就能随时欣赏大海。","If the hotel is too remote, I am afraid taking a taxi at night is unsafe.\t\t如果酒店太偏，我怕晚上打车不安全。","Mom suggested I check which European countries are visa-free for us.\t\t妈妈建议我查查哪些欧洲国家对我们免签。","The guest room is big, but it does not have a balcony.\t\t客房大是大，但是没有阳台。","spend Golden Week\t\t度过黄金周","popular attractions in Zhangjiajie\t\t张家界热门景点","I have bought the ticket, but the time does not really work.\t\t我买票是买了，但时间不太合适。","We decided to go sightseeing downtown tomorrow.\t\t我们决定明天去市区观光。","We did set out, but the weather is not very good.\t\t我们出发是出发了，但是天气不太好。","The guesthouse we booked is very out of the way, taking a taxi is inconvenient.\t\t我们订的民宿很偏，打车不方便。","We have left, but we have not yet reached the destination.\t\t我们走是走了，可是还没到目的地。","The room is cheap, but the facilities are average.\t\t房间便宜是便宜，只是设施一般。","introduction to cultural heritage\t\t文化遗产介绍","cultural heritage protection\t\t文化遗产保护","cultural heritage protection work\t\t文化遗产保护工作","Cultural heritage lets us understand our ancestors' way of life.\t\t文化遗产让我们了解祖先的生活方式。","Tomorrow we plan to go sightseeing downtown together.\t\t明天我们打算一起去市中心观光。","boring experience\t\t枯燥体验","Guilin Railway Station\t\t桂林火车站","guilin's famous scenic spots\t\t桂林著名景点","Check the electronic ticket\t\t检查电子票","price of a sea view room\t\t海景房价格","hot springs shuttle bus\t\t温泉接送车","Although the weather was bad, we still decided to go sightseeing.\t\t虽然天气不好，但我们还是决定去观光。","audio guide content\t\t语音导览内容","luxurious lobby\t\t豪华大厅","luxurious buffet\t\t豪华自助餐","luxurious facilities\t\t豪华设施","luxurious casino\t\t豪华赌场","luxurious balcony\t\t豪华阳台","buy electronic tickets\t\t购买电子票","casino hours\t\t赌场开放时间","super luxurious\t\t超级豪华","the casino on the cruise ship\t\t邮轮上的赌场","activities onboard the cruise ship\t\t邮轮内部活动","cruise services\t\t邮轮服务","cruise ticket price\t\t邮轮票价","cruise ship buffet\t\t邮轮自助餐","The balcony is big, but the view is average.\t\t阳台大是大，可是风景一般。","book first class\t\t预订头等舱","book a sea-view room\t\t预订海景房","book a cruise\t\t预订邮轮行程","attractions during Golden Week\t\t黄金周期间景点","golden week hotel reservations\t\t黄金周酒店预订"]],
  ["Devices: Explain device problems",["download new fonts\t\t下载新字体","product manual\t\t产品说明书","He just thinks there are too many notifications, that's all.\t\t他只是觉得通知太多罢了。","Before you go abroad, it is best to activate international roaming service.\t\t你出国前最好提前开通国际漫游服务。","You can set your phone to automatically filter spam messages.\t\t你可以设置手机自动过滤垃圾信息。","You can set up a fingerprint to unlock the phone.\t\t你可以设置指纹来解锁手机。","You can unlock your phone with your fingerprint.\t\t你可以通过指纹来解锁手机。","Do you usually mute notifications when you chat?\t\t你平时聊天的时候会静音通知吗？","Have you ever attended a virtual family gathering?\t\t你有没有参加过虚拟家庭聚会？","Have you ever tried changing your phone's font?\t\t你有没有试过更换手机字体？","Have you been emptying the recycle bin every month?\t\t你每个月都清理回收站了吗？","Which information do you think needs filtering?\t\t你觉得哪些信息需要过滤？","free calling feature\t\t免费通话功能","Turn off app reminders\t\t关闭应用提醒","turn off phone reminders\t\t关闭手机提醒","turn off mobile roaming\t\t关闭手机漫游","delete app icon\t\t删除应用图标","cancel calendar reminder\t\t取消日历提醒","Recycle Bin icon\t\t回收站图标","After she arrived in France, she activated international roaming service.\t\t她到法国后开通了国际漫游服务。","She just wants to focus on studying, that's all.\t\t她只是想专心学习罢了。","She uses a password to unlock the tablet every day.\t\t她每天都用密码解锁平板电脑。","If you forget the password, you cannot unlock the device.\t\t如果你忘记密码，就无法解锁设备。","If you are worried about being disturbed, you can mute your social apps.\t\t如果你怕被打扰，可以把社交软件静音。","If you can't connect to the network, you can restart the device.\t\t如果你连不上网络，可以重启一下设备。","If the phone cannot be unlocked, you need to contact customer service.\t\t如果手机无法解锁，你需要联系售后服务。","Mom suggested we share photos on social media so we can keep in touch.\t\t妈妈提议我们用社交软件分享照片，这样可以保持联系。","Mom thinks this new font looks very stylish.\t\t妈妈觉得这个新字体看起来很时尚。","It just disrupts my work, that's all.\t\t它只是打扰我工作罢了。","It just distracts me.\t\t它只是让我分心罢了。","work task reminder\t\t工作任务提醒","Many people are addicted to social media notifications, I do not want to become like that.\t\t很多人对社交媒体通知上瘾，我不想变成那样。","Our call was interrupted because the signal was poor.\t\t我们的通话因为信号不好中断了。","I found that my phone could not connect to Bluetooth devices.\t\t我发现我的手机无法连接蓝牙设备。","I'm just used to it, that's all.\t\t我只是习惯这样罢了。","I just like quiet, that's all.\t\t我只是喜欢宁静罢了。","I just want to focus on work, that's all.\t\t我只是想专注工作罢了。","I just want to be quiet, that's all.\t\t我只是想安静罢了。","I just want to focus, that's all.\t\t我只是想集中注意力罢了。","I just dislike noise, that's all.\t\t我只是讨厌噪音罢了。","I just need to rest, that's all.\t\t我只是需要休息罢了。","I suggest that you place the two Bluetooth devices a little closer.\t\t我建议你将两个蓝牙设备放得更近一些。","I plan to check my phone bill once a week.\t\t我打算每周检查一次自己的话费使用情况。","I suggest we video chat once a week.\t\t我提议我们每周都视频聊天一次。","I think your Bluetooth headphones are not properly connected to your phone.\t\t我觉得你的蓝牙耳机没有正确连上手机。","I think as long as you check notifications less, you are less likely to get addicted.\t\t我觉得只要少看通知，就不容易上瘾。","cell phone roaming signal\t\t手机漫游信号","drag the app icon\t\t拖动应用图标","drag the file icon\t\t拖动文件图标","recommended fonts\t\t推荐的字体","daily life reminders\t\t日常生活提醒","Yesterday's phone call made all of us very happy.\t\t昨天的通话让我们都很开心。","data usage warning notification\t\t流量警告提示","The teacher told me to use Bluetooth to connect the headphones, but I do not know how to do it.\t\t老师让我用蓝牙连耳机，但我不知道怎么操作。","save on cell phone bills\t\t节省手机话费","methods to reduce data usage\t\t节省流量方法","ways to save on phone bills\t\t节省话费方法","virtual friend\t\t虚拟好友","virtual platform\t\t虚拟平台","virtual reality\t\t虚拟现实","virtual classroom\t\t虚拟课堂","equipment manual\t\t设备说明书","detailed instruction manual\t\t详细说明书","the steps in the instruction manual\t\t说明书上的步骤","manual contents\t\t说明书内容","Does the manual mention needing to install additional software?\t\t说明书有没有提到需要安装额外的软件？","steps in the manual\t\t说明书步骤","adjust font size\t\t调整字体大小","recurring reminder\t\t重复的提醒","hide some icons\t\t隐藏部分图标"]],
  ["Environment: Share ways to go green",["an iron shovel\t\t一把铁铲子","not use chemical fertilizers\t\t不使用化肥","Without study, there is no progress.\t\t不学习不进步。","If you don't observe plants, you won't understand their needs.\t\t不观察植物不会了解它们的需求。","low-carbon means of transportation\t\t低碳交通工具","low-carbon shared bike\t\t低碳共享单车","If you don't try, you won't understand the joys of gardening.\t\t你不试试不会明白园艺的乐趣。","Have you ever tried using natural materials instead of pesticides?\t\t你有没有尝试过用天然材料代替农药？","Have you noticed that climate change is making summers hotter?\t\t你有没有注意到气候变化让夏天变得更热了？","Do you know that waste sorting can reduce pollution?\t\t你知道垃圾分类可以减少污染吗？","Do you think using shared bikes saves energy?\t\t你觉得使用共享单车节能吗？","Which landscaping measures do you think are most effective?\t\t你觉得哪些绿化措施最有效？","Do you think recycling trash has anything to do with environmental protection?\t\t你觉得回收垃圾和环保有关系吗？","What do you think is the biggest benefit of sorting trash?\t\t你觉得垃圾分类的最大好处是什么？","Using a shared bicycle not only saves money, but also allows you to exercise.\t\t使用共享单车不仅省钱，还能锻炼身体。","rely on renewable energy\t\t依赖可再生能源","protect icebergs\t\t保护冰山","Global warming may lead to more extreme weather.\t\t全球变暖可能会导致更多极端天气。","Global warming is a very serious problem.\t\t全球变暖是一个很严重的问题。","Global warming needs everyone's attention.\t\t全球变暖需要所有人关注。","Public transportation is not only convenient, it can also help us conserve energy.\t\t公共交通不仅方便，还能帮助我们节能。","park landscaping design\t\t公园绿化设计","shared bicycle travel\t\t共享单车出行","bike sharing app\t\t共享单车应用","methods to replace pesticides\t\t农药替代方法","reduce pesticide use\t\t减少农药使用","reduce reliance on chemical fertilizers\t\t减少化肥依赖","reduce oil use\t\t减少石油使用","use renewable materials\t\t利用可再生材料","use solar energy\t\t利用太阳能","strengthen greening efforts\t\t加强绿化工作","Arctic ecosystem\t\t北极生态系统","Arctic icebergs\t\t北极的冰山","gardening club\t\t园艺兴趣小组","horticultural plant selection\t\t园艺植物选择","increase green space\t\t增加绿化面积","natural pesticide selection\t\t天然农药选择","solar energy system\t\t太阳能系统","If we do not conserve energy, environmental problems will only become increasingly severe.\t\t如果我们不节能，环境问题只会越来越严重。","If we misuse chemical fertilizers, groundwater could become contaminated.\t\t如果我们乱用化肥，地下水可能会被污染。","If we ignore climate change, the consequences will be very serious.\t\t如果我们忽视气候变化，后果将会非常严重。","If we value garbage sorting, the Earth will become more beautiful.\t\t如果我们重视垃圾分类，地球会变得更美丽。","looking for a shared bicycle\t\t寻找共享单车","exhaust gas testing equipment\t\t尾气检测设备","huge iceberg\t\t巨大的冰山","How should we popularize the idea of water conservation?\t\t应该怎么普及节约用水的观念？","Many cities are now promoting low-carbon recycling programs.\t\t很多城市现在都在推广低碳回收计划。","We can promote environmental awareness in the community.\t\t我们可以在社区里普及环保的理念。","In our garden, we have not used chemical fertilizer for five years now.\t\t我们的花园里已经五年没有使用过化肥了。","Can we still stop the icebergs from continuing to melt?\t\t我们还能阻止冰山继续融化吗？","I suggest you bike to work because it saves energy.\t\t我建议你骑自行车上班，因为这样可以节能。","I am worried that global warming will cause more icebergs to melt.\t\t我担心全球变暖会导致更多冰山融化。","I'm worried that global warming will cause more icebergs to melt.\t\t我担心全球变暖会导致更多的冰山融化。","I think driving less can reduce exhaust pollution.\t\t我认为少开车可以减少尾气污染。","promote renewable materials\t\t推广可再生材料","promote knowledge of environmental protection\t\t推广环保知识","energy alternatives to oil\t\t替代石油能源","Without innovative technology, there is no efficient resource management.\t\t没有创新技术，就没有高效的资源管理。","Without plastic recycling, there will be no clean oceans.\t\t没有塑料回收，就没有干净的海洋。","Without metal recycling, there would be no new metal materials.\t\t没有金属回收，就没有新的金属材料。","clean the shovel\t\t清理铲子","environmentally friendly substitutes for pesticides\t\t环保替代农药","member of an environmental organization\t\t环保组织成员","energy alternatives to petroleum\t\t石油替代能源","oil consumption has decreased\t\t石油消耗减少","community landscaping plan\t\t社区绿化方案","community greening project\t\t社区绿化项目","Scientists are studying the impact of melting icebergs on climate change.\t\t科学家正在研究冰山融化对气候变化的影响。","rent a shared bicycle\t\t租一辆共享单车"]],
  ["Media: Discuss magazine sections",["make headlines\t\t上头条","special news coverage\t\t专题新闻报道","feature planning team\t\t专题策划团队","feature interview content\t\t专题采访内容","In fact, many young people no longer read traditional newspapers.\t\t事实上，很多年轻人已经不看传统报纸了。","In fact, almost no one in our family reads traditional newspapers anymore.\t\t事实上，我们家里几乎没人再看传统报纸了。","today's headline\t\t今天的头条","Why didn't they interview the important eyewitness?\t\t他们为什么没有采访重要的目击者？","They were late because of a traffic jam.\t\t他们因堵车而迟到了。","If they didn’t exaggerate the news, I might still keep following them.\t\t他们如果不夸大新闻，我也许还会继续关注。","They had planned to interview the guest, but the guest changed their schedule on short notice.\t\t他们本来打算采访嘉宾，但嘉宾临时改变了行程。","He did not take part in this report because he was dealing with other issues.\t\t他因处理其他问题而没参与这次报道。","He is unable to conduct a live broadcast due to illness.\t\t他因生病不能进行直播。","He chose to resign because of this incident.\t\t他因这次事件选择辞职。","Have you noticed that they like to exaggerate social problems?\t\t你有没有发现他们喜欢夸大社会问题？","Have you noticed that their recent reporting lacks depth?\t\t你有没有发现他们最近的报道缺乏深度？","Do you know why they are going to record this interview?\t\t你知道为什么他们要录制这次采访吗？","Do you know why the journalist did not delve into the details of the incident?\t\t你知道为什么记者没有深入了解事件的细节吗？","Do you know why this segment chose to feature technological innovation?\t\t你知道为什么这个栏目会选择介绍科技创新吗？","Do you know why they want to record the interview with the expert?\t\t你知道他们为什么要录制专家的采访吗？","Do you know why the newspaper didn't send a reporter?\t\t你知道报社为什么没有派记者吗？","Do you know why the newspaper can't send a reporter this time?\t\t你知道这次为什么报社派不出记者吗？","Do you think this story is really controversial?\t\t你觉得这个故事真的有争议吗？","Which commentator's analysis do you think is most convincing?\t\t你认为哪位评论员的分析最有说服力？","public information\t\t公众信息","public participation activities\t\t公众参与活动","changes in public demand\t\t公众需求变化","content summary\t\t内容简要","the publisher's report\t\t出版社的报道","news from the publisher\t\t出版社的新闻","commercial real estate updates\t\t商业房地产动态","For some reason, the concert was canceled.\t\t因一些原因，演唱会取消了。","Because the information was not accurate enough, some viewers chose to unsubscribe.\t\t因信息不够准确，一些观众选择取消订阅。","Since the information was repetitive, she decided to switch to another channel.\t\t因信息重复，她决定换别的频道。","Because of the weather, many airports are closed.\t\t因天气原因，很多机场都关了。","Because there are too many commercials, many people no longer watch that channel.\t\t因广告过多，很多人不再收看该频道。","foreign publisher\t\t外国出版社","large publishing house\t\t大型出版社","If the newspaper had notified the reporters in advance, the situation might have been different.\t\t如果报社提前通知记者，情况也许会不同。","If the newspaper gets the news early, the reporters can arrive on time.\t\t如果报社能提前接到消息，记者就能准时到达。","If the news has no depth, will you continue to follow it?\t\t如果新闻没有深度，你会继续关注吗？","If the news does not have enough depth, I will not continue to follow it.\t\t如果新闻没有足够的深度，我就不会继续关注。","small press\t\t小型出版社","addressing the challenge of aging\t\t应对老龄化挑战","addressing an aging society\t\t应对老龄化社会","make headlines\t\t成为头条","Most of us follow international news.\t\t我们大多关注国际新闻。","real estate investment analysis\t\t房地产投资分析","real estate industry coverage\t\t房地产行业报道","a newly established publishing house\t\t新开的出版社","special news report\t\t新闻专题报道","news report\t\t新闻报道","The news channel airs the day's major news on time every day.\t\t新闻频道每天都会准时播出当天的重大新闻。","Yesterday the teacher asked me why I had been unable to go interview that expert.\t\t昨天老师问我为什么没能去采访那位专家。","change publisher\t\t更换出版社","controversial event\t\t有争议的事件","Sometimes, commentators invite experts to take part in discussions of news events.\t\t有时候，评论员会邀请专家参与讨论新闻事件。","local real estate market\t\t本地房地产市场","the magazine's column arrangement\t\t杂志的栏目设置","in-depth reporting segment\t\t栏目深度报道","The game was postponed because of the weather.\t\t比赛因天气原因推迟了。","satisfy the public's interest\t\t满足公众兴趣","trending headlines\t\t热门头条","popular section topics\t\t热门栏目话题","onsite report\t\t现场报道","The TV station airs the latest news reports every day.\t\t电视台每天都会播出最新的新闻报道。","related coverage\t\t相关报道","brief answer\t\t简要回答","news brief\t\t简要新闻","brief expression\t\t简要表达","brief description\t\t简要说明","lack of in-depth reporting\t\t缺乏深度报道","the effects of aging\t\t老龄化带来的影响","the social structure of an aging society\t\t老龄化社会结构","problems of an aging society\t\t老龄化社会问题","false advertising\t\t虚假广告","false story\t\t虚假故事","false data\t\t虚假数据","false story\t\t虚假的故事","Most of the audience is more interested in environmental issues.\t\t观众大多对环境问题更感兴趣。","Journalists and commentators often work together to analyze news events.\t\t记者和评论员经常合作分析新闻事件。","Most reporters choose to cover controversial issues.\t\t记者大多会选择报道有争议的事。","Reporters need to go to the accident scene to learn all the details.\t\t记者得深入事故现场了解所有细节。","The reporter was not able to go to the scene for in depth reporting.\t\t记者没能深入现场进行报道。","the reporter's report\t\t记者的报道","After the reporter finished the interview, the television station immediately broadcast the news.\t\t记者采访完后，电视台立刻播出了新闻。","columns that readers like\t\t读者喜欢的栏目","this column's content\t\t这个栏目内容","invite the commentator to speak\t\t邀请评论员发言","That writer passed away because of illness.\t\t那位作家因病去世了。","that publishing house\t\t那家出版社","interview a real estate expert\t\t采访房地产专家","major headline\t\t重要头条","highly controversial\t\t非常有争议"]],
  ["Stories: Express how a show made you feel",["A good script should have characters that people like.\t\t一个好的剧本应该有人们所喜欢的角色。","a small bright spot\t\t一个小亮点","a small fox\t\t一只小狐狸","a poem\t\t一首诗歌","next chapter\t\t下一章节","different images\t\t不同的形象","rich paragraph content\t\t丰富的段落内容","theme expression methods\t\t主题表达方式","Everything he says moves me.\t\t他所说的每句话都让我感动。","What he said really moved me.\t\t他所说的话让我很感动。","What he said moved me.\t\t他所说的话让我感动。","Which fables do you usually recommend to your friends?\t\t你平时会向朋友推荐哪些寓言故事？","Were you deeply moved by that ending?\t\t你有没有深深地被那个结局打动？","Which character's portrayal do you think is the most realistic?\t\t你认为哪个角色的形象最真实？","fables that children like\t\t儿童喜欢的寓言","analyze the poem's content\t\t分析诗歌内容","script analysis\t\t剧本分析","animal fables\t\t动物寓言","a spectacular scene\t\t场面壮观","She would rather be misunderstood, yet she insists on doing the right thing.\t\t她宁可被误解，也坚持做正确的事。","What she said moved me.\t\t她所说的话让我感动。","If I were an orphan, I would bravely face life.\t\t如果我是孤儿，我会勇敢面对生活。","an orphan's story\t\t孤儿的故事","Fables convey profound meaning through interesting stories.\t\t寓言通过有趣的故事传达深刻的意义。","common metaphors\t\t常见的比喻","Zhang Hua is responsible for preparing all the props related to the story.\t\t张华负责准备所有和故事相关的道具。","vivid metaphor\t\t形象的比喻","I found that the main character would rather give up their wealth to protect their family.\t\t我发现主角宁可放弃财富，也要保护家人。","When I am reading this poem, I imagine that I am traveling.\t\t我在读这首诗的时候幻想自己正在旅行。","I prefer the ending that this author wrote.\t\t我更喜欢这个作者所写的结局。","I was deeply moved by the lead actor's performance.\t\t我深深地被主角的表演打动了。","I was deeply moved by the female lead's performance.\t\t我深深地被女主角的表演打动了。","I was deeply moved by the protagonist.\t\t我被主角深深地感动了。","I think the combination of lighting and props makes the stage more realistic.\t\t我认为灯光和道具的搭配让舞台更真实。","When I read poetry, I often imagine a beautiful world.\t\t我读诗的时候常常幻想一个美丽的世界。","grasp the main theme\t\t抓住主要主题","educational fable\t\t教育意义的寓言","the latest drama\t\t最新一部剧","interesting fable\t\t有趣的寓言","read poetry aloud\t\t朗读诗歌","foxes in the forest\t\t森林里的狐狸","each paragraph's key points\t\t每个段落重点","the highlights of the lighting effects\t\t灯光效果的亮点","a lively scene\t\t热闹的场面","The Fox and the Grapes\t\t狐狸与葡萄","a fox's tail\t\t狐狸的尾巴","unique highlight\t\t独特的亮点","Wang Ming hopes to play the lead next time rather than a supporting role.\t\t王明希望下次能扮演主角，而不是配角。","understanding the poet's metaphor\t\t理解诗人的比喻","understanding poetry\t\t理解诗歌","understanding a poem's theme\t\t理解诗歌主题","vivid fable characters\t\t生动的寓言角色","vivid metaphor\t\t生动的比喻","movie lines\t\t电影台词","chapter content\t\t章节内容","chapter content analysis\t\t章节内容分析","chapter organization\t\t章节安排","first paragraph\t\t第一段落","spectacular highlights\t\t精彩的亮点","wonderful fable\t\t精彩的寓言","excellent paragraph\t\t精彩的段落","classic lines\t\t经典台词","classic television dramas\t\t经典电视剧","classic poetry\t\t经典诗歌","final paragraph\t\t结尾段落","the highlights the audience cares about\t\t观众关注的亮点","After reading a poem, I often envision different endings.\t\t读完诗后，我常常幻想不同的结局。","This fable clearly conveys the author's ideas.\t\t这个寓言清楚地传达了作者的想法。","What message is this story trying to convey?\t\t这个故事想传达什么样的意义？","This story has the inspiration you need.\t\t这个故事有你所需要的启发。","This ending is not what I expected.\t\t这个结局不是我所期待的。","introduction to the supporting characters\t\t配角介绍","key lines of dialogue\t\t重要台词","important scene\t\t重要的场面","important chapters\t\t重要的章节","important props\t\t重要的道具"]],
  ["Customs: Ask about etiquette rules",["Don't be afraid, just ask!\t\t不要害怕，问问题就是了！","crow legend\t\t乌鸦传说","the symbolism of the crow\t\t乌鸦的象征","an affectionate term of address\t\t亲切的称呼","Do you know why younger people need to serve tea to elders?\t\t你知道为什么晚辈需要给长辈敬茶吗？","Do you know when you should bow?\t\t你知道什么时候应该鞠躬吗？","Do you know in what situations you need to bow to show respect?\t\t你知道在什么场合需要鞠躬表示尊重吗？","Can you give an example to explain what an open personality is?\t\t你能举例说明什么是开放的性格吗？","Do you understand indirect expressions?\t\t你能理解含蓄的表达方式吗？","Which animals do you think symbolize friendship?\t\t你觉得哪些动物象征友谊？","Which work arrangement do you think suits you better?\t\t你觉得哪种工作模式更适合你？","Do you think it is important to follow etiquette in public?\t\t你觉得在公共场合遵守礼节重要吗？","Do you think using gestures to communicate with others is useful?\t\t你觉得用手势和别人沟通有用吗？","Do you think straightforward people make friends more easily?\t\t你觉得直率的人更容易交朋友吗？","Do you think speaking this way in China would offend clients?\t\t你认为在中国这样说话会冒犯客户吗？","Just use translation software.\t\t使用翻译软件就是了。","be straightforward\t\t做人直率","friendly hand gesture\t\t友好的手势","cooperation model\t\t合作模式","a reserved attitude\t\t含蓄的态度","indirect communication\t\t含蓄的沟通","If you do not understand, just listen a few more times, that is all.\t\t听不懂就多听几遍就是了。","If you don't understand, just ask a few more times, that's all.\t\t听不懂就多问几次就是了。","When you don't understand, just smile and nod.\t\t听不懂的时候，微笑点头就是了。","In India, the elephant symbolizes wisdom and strength.\t\t在印度，大象象征智慧和力量。","determined gaze\t\t坚定的眼神","basic etiquette\t\t基本礼节","She recognizes the importance of people understanding one another.\t\t她认同大家互相理解的重要性。","If you don't understand, I can explain it again with another example.\t\t如果你不明白，我可以再举例解释一下。","If you use the wrong gesture to show friendliness, you might embarrass yourself.\t\t如果你用错误的手势表示友好，可能会闹笑话。","If we do not understand the local culture, we can easily embarrass ourselves.\t\t如果我们不了解当地文化，就很容易闹笑话。","If I have ever offended you, please forgive me.\t\t如果我曾经冒犯你，请原谅我。","If I agree with your view, we can try a new method.\t\t如果我认同你的看法，我们可以尝试新方法。","a shy gaze\t\t害羞的眼神","kinship terms\t\t家庭称呼","respectful form of address\t\t尊重的称呼","common hand gestures\t\t常见的手势","My colleague and I in formal settings will bow first, and only then shake hands.\t\t我和我的同事在正式场合会先鞠躬，然后才握手。","I often feel confused about forms of address.\t\t我常常因为称呼的问题感到困惑。","I appreciate the teacher's candor because she never hides her true thoughts.\t\t我欣赏老师的直率，因为她从不隐藏真实想法。","I agree with the study method you mentioned because it is very effective.\t\t我认同你说的学习方法，因为它很有效。","master etiquette\t\t掌握礼节","A handshake shows respect, in addition, it can build trust.\t\t握手表示尊重；此外，能建立信任。","educational model\t\t教育模式","cultural model\t\t文化模式","cultural etiquette\t\t文化礼节","dialect communication\t\t方言交流","dialectal modes of expression\t\t方言表达方式","dialect vocabulary\t\t方言词汇","the younger generation respectfully offers tea\t\t晚辈敬茶","wise crow\t\t智慧的乌鸦","understand the other person's gestures\t\t理解对方手势","lifestyle\t\t生活模式","forms of address\t\t称呼方式","Red stands for wealth, it also brings to mind passion.\t\t红色代表财富，此外，也让人想到热情。","red dragon\t\t红色的龙","The teacher asked the students if they understood, some nodded, some shook their heads.\t\t老师问学生是否明白，学生们有的点头，有的摇头。","body language signals\t\t肢体语言信号","the importance of body language\t\t肢体语言的重要性","misinterpret body language\t\t误解肢体语言","These sculptures symbolize the city's history and culture.\t\t这些雕塑象征城市的历史与文化。","When you run into a language barrier, just practice more.\t\t遇到语言障碍，多练习就是了。","When you come across a confusing topic, just smile.\t\t遇到难懂的话题，微笑一下就是了。","observe etiquette\t\t遵守礼节","the legend of the dragon\t\t龙的传说","the dragon's power\t\t龙的力量","the image of the dragon\t\t龙的形象"]],
  ["Technology: Discuss safe online habits",["continuous improvement\t\t不断的改进","knowledge of internet security\t\t互联网安全知识","internet security issues\t\t互联网安全问题","the internet age\t\t互联网时代","online social platform\t\t互联网社交平台","areas for product improvement\t\t产品改进方向","Have you ever blocked a new friend because of an argument?\t\t你有没有因为争吵拉黑过新朋友？","Can your cell phone connect directly to the printer?\t\t你的手机可以直接连接打印机吗？","At what age do you think children can use the internet?\t\t你觉得孩子多大可以使用互联网？","a life full of fantasy\t\t充满幻想的生活","memory usage\t\t内存使用情况","delete hard drive files\t\t删除硬盘文件","uses too much memory\t\t占用过多内存","launch the new program\t\t启动新程序","At school, children will more or less all be exposed to computers.\t\t在学校孩子们或多或少都会接触到电脑。","If someone frequently posts advertisements, I will consider blocking him.\t\t如果有人频繁发广告，我会考虑拉黑他。","Children will be more or less attracted to technology.\t\t孩子们或多或少会被科技吸引。","install necessary programs\t\t安装必要程序","life test results\t\t寿命测试结果","The platform will match us with friends based on our interests.\t\t平台会根据兴趣帮我们配对朋友。","life expectancy comparison\t\t平均寿命对比","imaginary friend\t\t幻想朋友","methods to extend lifespan\t\t延长寿命方法","Our first face to face date was in a coffee shop.\t\t我们第一次面对面约会是在一个咖啡馆里。","We need to study hard to dispel misconceptions about artificial intelligence.\t\t我们需要努力学习，才能打破对人工智能的误解。","I find the WiFi signal at home is more stable.\t\t我发现无线网络在家里的信号更稳定。","I like using a wireless mouse because it is very convenient.\t\t我喜欢使用无线鼠标，因为它很方便。","My younger sister really likes to use new software to identify various kinds of fruit.\t\t我妹妹很喜欢用新软件识别各种水果。","I suggest you first uninstall those programs you have not used in a long time.\t\t我建议你先卸载那些很久没用的程序。","I suggest you uninstall some apps you rarely use.\t\t我建议你卸载一些很少用的应用。","Yesterday I blocked a new friend because of a misunderstanding.\t\t我昨天因为一场误会拉黑了一个新朋友。","My daughter can use a tablet to recognize different animals now.\t\t我的女儿可以用平板电脑识别不同的动物了。","My new headphones are wireless, and they are very convenient to use.\t\t我的新耳机是无线的，用起来很方便。","I believe AI can help us break with traditional ways of thinking.\t\t我相信人工智能可以帮助我们打破传统的思维方式。","I think AI can help us break down barriers to learning.\t\t我认为人工智能可以帮助我们打破学习上的障碍。","I think artificial intelligence can help us break down communication barriers.\t\t我认为人工智能可以帮助我们打破沟通障碍。","I think artificial intelligence can help us break down communication barriers.\t\t我认为人工智能能够帮助我们打破沟通上的障碍。","I think we will get used to using artificial intelligence sooner or later.\t\t我认为我们迟早会习惯使用人工智能。","I think wireless technology makes life smarter and more efficient.\t\t我认为无线技术让生活更加智能和高效。","I made a few new friends through the matching system.\t\t我通过系统配对认识了几个新朋友。","Even though printers are useful, computers have stronger functionality.\t\t打印机虽然有用，但是电脑的功能更强大。","new printer\t\t新的打印机","update all programs\t\t更新所有程序","a friend's date\t\t朋友的约会","Every application has shortcomings, large or small.\t\t每个应用都有或大或小的缺点。","browser security\t\t浏览器安全","browser recommendations\t\t浏览器推荐","browser support\t\t浏览器支持","browser settings\t\t浏览器设置","free up hard drive space\t\t清理硬盘空间","Wang Ming thought the other person was too annoying, so he blocked him last night.\t\t王明觉得对方太烦，所以昨晚拉黑了他。","hard drive usage\t\t硬盘使用情况","Sooner or later, technology will change our way of life.\t\t科技迟早会改变我们的生活方式。","childhood fantasies\t\t童年幻想","childhood fantasies\t\t童年的幻想","system improvement suggestions\t\t系统改进建议","remote control function\t\t远程控制功能","remote control system\t\t远程控制系统","distance education platform\t\t远程教育平台","remote surveillance camera\t\t远程监控摄像头"]],
  ["Shopping: Share your shopping mistakes",["different price points\t\t不同的价位","He is not just unhappy, he is full of regret.\t\t他不但不开心，反而很后悔。","price advantage\t\t价位优势","price range selection\t\t价位选择","values\t\t价值理念","affordable price\t\t价格实惠","traditional jewelry craftsmanship\t\t传统珠宝工艺","Not only were you not happy, instead you became even angrier.\t\t你不但不高兴，反而更生气了。","Why don't you consider a more durable option?\t\t你为什么不考虑一下更耐用的选择？","Why do you want to boycott this company's products?\t\t你为什么要抵制这家公司的产品？","Does the dishwasher you bought use a lot of water?\t\t你买的洗碗机会不会很费水？","Do you like niche or popular jewelry brands?\t\t你喜欢小众还是流行的珠宝品牌？","Have you ever actively boycotted certain products?\t\t你有没有主动抵制过某些产品？","Have you ever considered handmade jewelry?\t\t你有没有考虑过手工制作的珠宝？","Do you know what products help to protect water resources?\t\t你知道哪些产品有助于保护水资源吗？","Do you know how much one gram of gold costs now?\t\t你知道现在黄金一克多少钱吗？","Do you know where this brand is from?\t\t你知道这个品牌的产地在哪里吗？","Do you know where this necklace was made?\t\t你知道这个项链的产地在哪里吗？","Do you think farm eggs are healthier than supermarket eggs?\t\t你觉得农场的鸡蛋比超市的更健康吗？","Do you think shopping at small stores is more meaningful than shopping at supermarkets?\t\t你觉得在小店消费比在超市更有意义吗？","Do you think the new fridge uses a lot of electricity?\t\t你觉得新冰箱费电吗？","Do you think this kind of washing machine uses a lot of water?\t\t你觉得这种洗衣机费水吗？","rely on origin labels\t\t依赖产地标签","counterfeit goods complaint\t\t假货投诉","counterfeit goods trap\t\t假货陷阱","risk of counterfeit goods\t\t假货风险","shared ideals\t\t共同的理念","pay attention to the place of origin\t\t关注产地来源","visit an organic farm\t\t参观有机农场","sustainable water resources\t\t可持续水资源","various price points\t\t各种价位","retro phone case\t\t复古手机壳","retro leather shoes\t\t复古皮鞋","retro color scheme\t\t复古色彩搭配","retro sound system\t\t复古音响","Not only did she not buy an ordinary dishwasher, she chose the latest model instead.\t\t她不但没买普通的洗碗机，反而选择了最新款。","affordable consumption\t\t实惠消费","affordable price\t\t实惠的价格","an affordable choice\t\t实惠的选择","practical small electrical appliances\t\t实用小型电器","practical electrical appliances\t\t实用电器","Designs from niche brands often pleasantly surprise me.\t\t小众品牌的设计常常让我感到惊喜。","niche market\t\t小众市场","Milk from small farms is much fresher than supermarket milk.\t\t小农场的牛奶比超市的牛奶新鲜多了。","cheap cell phone\t\t廉价手机","cheap materials\t\t廉价材料","use of cheap materials\t\t廉价材料使用","want durable clothes\t\t想要耐用的衣服","We not only didn’t replace the old furniture, we decided to refurbish it instead.\t\t我们不但没换旧家具，反而决定翻新它们。","I think shopping at small stores is warmer and more fun.\t\t我觉得在小商店消费更有温度，也更有乐趣。","I think the price of this phone is pretty reasonable.\t\t我觉得这个手机的价位比较合理。","I chose this refrigerator because it is very energy efficient.\t\t我选择这款冰箱是因为它非常节能。","handmade jewelry brand\t\t手工珠宝品牌","refuse to buy counterfeit goods\t\t拒绝购买假货","water resources protection\t\t水资源保护","the concept is clear\t\t理念清晰","experience using appliances\t\t电器使用体验","real jewelry\t\t真正的珠宝","online counterfeit goods\t\t网上假货","durable furniture\t\t耐用的家具","durable tools\t\t耐用的工具","durable materials\t\t耐用的材料","energy-efficient washing machine\t\t节能洗衣机","energy-efficient light bulb\t\t节能灯泡","energy efficient air conditioner\t\t节能空调","Although inexpensive, these tools are not durable enough.\t\t虽然价格便宜，但这些工具不够耐用。","calculate shipping cost\t\t计算运费","identify counterfeit goods\t\t辨别假货","shipping discount\t\t运费优惠","Choose energy-efficient products\t\t选择节能产品","encounter counterfeit goods\t\t遇到假货","extra shipping fee\t\t额外运费","high efficiency energy saving electrical appliances\t\t高效节能电器","premium jewelry collection\t\t高档珠宝系列","gold price\t\t黄金价格","gold necklace\t\t黄金项链"]],
  ["Nature: Plan your camping trip",["personal medication instructions\t\t个人药品说明","personal record\t\t个人记录","Penguins cannot fly, but they swim very well.\t\t企鹅不会飞，但它们游泳非常厉害。","penguin life\t\t企鹅的生活","experience diverse cultures\t\t体验多样文化","Why don't you take a break right here and wait until everyone comes back?\t\t你为什么不就地休息一下，等大家都回来？","You should pay attention to changes in the weather, bring suitable clothing.\t\t你应该留意天气变化，带上合适的衣服。","Do you want to see blue icebergs in Antarctica with your own eyes?\t\t你想在南极亲眼看到蓝色冰山吗？","Are you interested in learning about the traditional culture of Indigenous peoples?\t\t你有兴趣了解原住民的传统文化吗？","Have you noticed that the guide is always very familiar with these small paths?\t\t你有没有发现向导总是很熟悉这些小路？","Do you know when they will start charging?\t\t你知道他们什么时候开始收费的吗？","Do you know why penguins have not gone extinct?\t\t你知道企鹅为什么没有灭绝吗？","Do you know which medications are suitable for outdoor use?\t\t你知道哪些药品适合户外使用吗？","Can you tell me how to organize this equipment?\t\t你能告诉我怎么收纳这些装备吗？","How do you think the forest here is recovering?\t\t你觉得这里的森林恢复得怎么样？","communal kettle\t\t公共水壶","waste sorting bags\t\t分类垃圾袋","Antarctic marine life\t\t南极海洋生物","antarctic ecosystem conservation\t\t南极生态保护","Antarctic penguins\t\t南极的企鹅","Antarctica's cold climate\t\t南极的寒冷气候","indigenous cultural experience\t\t原住民文化体验","The Indigenous people invited us to learn their traditional dance together.\t\t原住民邀请我们一起学习他们的传统舞蹈。","guide arranges the itinerary\t\t向导安排行程","preparation of basic medications\t\t基础药品准备","plastic garbage bag\t\t塑料垃圾袋","topical medication selection\t\t外用药品选择","diverse ecosystems\t\t多样的生态系统","diverse organisms\t\t多样的生物","If you bring a pet, the campground will also charge an extra fee.\t\t如果你带宠物来，营地也会额外收费。","If you book the campsite in advance, the owner will charge based on the number of people.\t\t如果你提前预订营地，老板会根据人数收费。","If you get up early, we can go to the lakeside to watch birds.\t\t如果你早起，我们就能去湖边观鸟。","If you look closely, you'll find many interesting little insects!\t\t如果你留意观察，会发现很多有趣的小昆虫！","The tour guide told us why penguins cannot fly.\t\t导游告诉我们企鹅为什么不能飞。","The tour guide said that as long as everyone protects the environment, the forest can gradually regain its health.\t\t导游说，只要大家保护环境，森林就能逐步恢复健康。","pleasant sounding music\t\t悦耳的音乐","We decided to put up tents on the spot at the campsite to avoid damaging the environment.\t\t我们决定在营地就地搭帐篷，避免破坏环境。","We will go to the valley early tomorrow morning to watch birds.\t\t我们明天一早要去山谷里观鸟。","We need to store everything in this box.\t\t我们要把所有东西收纳到这个箱子里。","My friend and I decided to go birding in the forest rather than go mountain climbing.\t\t我和朋友决定在森林里观鸟，而不是去爬山。","My friend and I were watching birds in the forest and discovered many rare bird species.\t\t我和朋友在森林里观鸟，发现了很多稀有鸟类。","I saw lush green plants in the rainforest.\t\t我在雨林里看到了茂盛的绿色植物。","I really am not very good at organizing.\t\t我真的不太擅长收纳。","photo log\t\t拍照记录","travel medicine kit\t\t旅行药品箱","Yesterday I saw them cooking right there by the river, it was very interesting.\t\t昨天我看到他们在河边就地做饭，很有趣。","the melodious sounds in the forest\t\t森林里的悦耳声音","tropical animal world\t\t热带动物世界","tropical natural environment\t\t热带自然环境","tropical bird observation\t\t热带鸟类观察","enthusiastic guide\t\t热情的向导","The teacher reminded everyone not to go off on their own, and to clean up the trash where they were.\t\t老师提醒大家不要随意离开，要就地整理垃圾。","As for transportation, we can rent an electric vehicle.\t\t至于交通，我们可以租一辆电动车。","As for transportation, we can rent a car.\t\t至于交通，我们可以租一辆车。","As for transportation, we plan to rent a car.\t\t至于交通，我们打算租车。","As for the food, we will prepare it ourselves.\t\t至于食物，我们会自己准备。","lush leaves\t\t茂盛的树叶","fill the kettle up\t\t装满水壶","full garbage bag\t\t装满的垃圾袋","Watching birds not only helps us understand nature but also helps us relax.\t\t观鸟不仅能帮助我们了解自然，还能让我们放松心情。","video recording\t\t视频记录","Please check your backpack. Did you bring the water bottle?\t\t请你检查一下背包，水壶带了吗？","Everyone, please protect the environment together and prevent animals from going extinct!\t\t请大家一起保护环境，防止动物灭绝！","rain forest ecosystem\t\t雨林生态系统"]],
  ["Orders: Request order cancellation",["The viewpoints in some articles are confusing.\t\t一些文章的观点令人困惑。","The wool hat I bought last week has a strange smell.\t\t上周我买的羊毛帽子有股奇怪的味道。","doesn't fit very well\t\t不太合身","The services they provided saved me a lot of trouble.\t\t他们提供的服务让我省了很多麻烦。","They said the new TV comes with a two-year warranty.\t\t他们说新买的电视可以保修两年。","reassuring\t\t令人安心","enviable\t\t令人羡慕","Do you know the current editor's background?\t\t你了解现在这位编辑的背景吗？","Do you know how to cancel a subscription online?\t\t你知道怎么在线取消订阅吗？","Could you tell me why this item has been out of stock for so long?\t\t你能告诉我，这款衣服为什么一直缺货吗？","Can you help me check this invoice?\t\t你能帮我核对一下这张发票吗？","Do you think an auto-reply system can make things easier?\t\t你觉得自动回复系统能省事吗？","a pleasant surprise\t\t叫人惊喜","the right size\t\t合身的尺寸","unique number\t\t唯一的编号","If a product is out of stock, will you proactively notify customers?\t\t如果一个产品缺货，你们会主动通知客户吗？","If you need more information, I'll send it to you later.\t\t如果你需要更多资料，我稍后会发给你。","If the publisher can reduce the print run, I might keep my subscription.\t\t如果出版社能减少印刷数量，我或许会继续订阅。","If the seller does not ship today, I will consider canceling the order.\t\t如果卖家今天不发货，我会考虑取消订单。","If customer service can explain the free shipping policy clearly, I will be more satisfied.\t\t如果客服能够解释清楚包邮政策，我会更满意。","If I bought the product abroad, will you still honor the warranty?\t\t如果我在国外购买了产品，你们还会保修吗？","If anyone deliberately damages property, the company will investigate.\t\t如果有人故意损坏物品，公司会调查。","If a product is out of stock, will you notify customers in advance?\t\t如果某个产品缺货，你们会提前通知客户吗？","If shipping is delayed any further, I will request a refund.\t\t如果物流再拖延下去，我会要求退款。","customer's description\t\t客户的描述","The courier said the box’s outer packaging was already damaged.\t\t快递员说箱子的外包装已经损坏。","We have already shipped as scheduled, but the customer still has not received the goods.\t\t我们公司已经按照约定时间发货了，但是客户还没有收到货物。","I noticed the shipping box’s outer packaging was already damaged.\t\t我发现快递箱的外包装已经损坏了。","After discussing with my friend, we believe there is no need to continue printing.\t\t我和朋友讨论过后，觉得继续印刷没有必要。","I already signed for the package, but the contents are incomplete.\t\t我已经签收包裹，可是里面的物品不完整。","I hope next time they can still help me save more money.\t\t我希望下次他们还能帮我省更多钱。","I am very satisfied with this store's free shipping service.\t\t我很满意这家店的包邮服务。","I called customer service and asked them to verify my order information.\t\t我打电话给客服，请他们核对我的订单信息。","Yesterday at the bank I checked my account information.\t\t我昨天在银行核对了我的账户信息。","I had a shipping delay yesterday.\t\t我昨天遇到了物流延误的问题。","I think if magazines rely only on traditional printing, content updates will be very slow.\t\t我认为如果杂志只靠传统印刷，内容更新就会很慢。","I need to know more, please send me the information later.\t\t我需要了解更多，请稍后把资料发给我。","newly bought wool overcoat\t\t新买的羊毛大衣","find the tracking number\t\t查找快递编号","look up order number\t\t查询订单编号","logistics tracking information\t\t物流追踪信息","After signing for it, I immediately contacted customer service, hoping to resolve the issue as soon as possible.\t\t签收后我立刻联系了客服，希望能尽快解决问题。","changes in editing style\t\t编辑的风格变化","Even though the editor works hard, the magazine's content still fails to move me.\t\t虽然编辑很努力，但杂志的内容还是无法打动我。","trustworthy\t\t让人信任","worrying\t\t让人担心","detailed description\t\t详细的描述","May I ask when you will be able to ship?\t\t请问你什么时候才能发货？","Excuse me, what should I do if I discover an issue with the product after I sign for it?\t\t请问如果签收后发现产品有问题，我应该怎么办？","enter the tracking number\t\t输入快递编号","expired subscription\t\t过期的订阅","description of problem symptoms\t\t问题现象描述","detailed problem description\t\t问题详细描述"]],
  ["Solidarity: Talk about helping others",["personal statement\t\t个人声明","In order to change this situation, everyone must cooperate.\t\t为了改变这种情况，大家非合作不可。","charity sale merchandise area\t\t义卖商品区","charity sale proceeds\t\t义卖收入","strive for safety\t\t争取安全","This year we must change.\t\t今年我们非改变不可。","You will not let me go, I must go.\t\t你不让我去，我非去不可。","Why did you choose to donate money to the children's hospital?\t\t你为什么选择向儿童医院捐款？","Would you protest over environmental issues?\t\t你会因为环境问题去抗议吗？","Are you willing to witness more beautiful changes with me?\t\t你愿意和我一起见证更多美好的变化吗？","Have you ever taken part in a community charity sale?\t\t你有没有参加过社区的义卖？","Do you know that all the proceeds from the charity sale have been donated to charitable organizations?\t\t你知道义卖的所有收入都捐给了慈善机构吗？","Do you know why they want to protest?\t\t你知道他们为什么要抗议吗？","Do you know why they are going on strike?\t\t你知道他们为什么要罢工吗？","Do you know why volunteers need to report activity results regularly?\t\t你知道志愿者为什么需要定期报告活动结果吗？","Do you think the residents' safety awareness has increased?\t\t你觉得居民的安全意识提高了吗？","public safety awareness\t\t公共安全意识","public statement\t\t公开声明","shared consciousness\t\t共同的意识","care about stray dogs\t\t关心流浪狗","pay attention to safety\t\t关注安全","Join the union\t\t加入工会","awareness of participation has increased\t\t参与意识增强","issue a statement\t\t发表声明","feeding stray dogs\t\t喂养流浪狗","unity and cooperation\t\t团结合作","united neighbors\t\t团结的邻居","stray dogs in the city\t\t城市里的流浪狗","strengthen the sense of community\t\t增强社区意识","If we do not act immediately, the problem will only become more serious.\t\t如果我们不立即行动，问题只会变得更严重。","If there is no justice, society becomes chaotic.\t\t如果没有正义，社会就会变得混乱。","school charity sale\t\t学校义卖活动","resident safety\t\t居民安全","The workers decided to go on strike to demand higher wages.\t\t工人们为了争取更高的工资决定罢工。","The workers decided to go on strike because their wages were too low.\t\t工人们因为工资太低决定罢工。","The workers decided to go on strike because wages are too low.\t\t工人因为工资太低决定罢工。","union representative\t\t工会代表","labor union meeting\t\t工会会议","labor union member\t\t工会成员","union benefits\t\t工会福利","labor union\t\t工会组织","Many people are protesting because the government has broken its promise.\t\t很多人抗议是因为政府违背了承诺。","Many citizens are already environmentally conscious.\t\t很多市民已经有了环保意识。","The volunteers came together to help other people.\t\t志愿者们联合起来，为别人提供帮助。","Volunteers will carry out activities together with the community.\t\t志愿者会联合社区一起开展活动。","If volunteers can work together, the results will be better.\t\t志愿者如果能够联合行动，效果会更好。","Every day, volunteers must report their own work progress to the person in charge.\t\t志愿者每天都要向负责人报告自己的工作进展。","Every day, volunteers have to report on work progress to their supervisors.\t\t志愿者每天都要向领导报告工作进展。","We witnessed the establishment of the community garden together.\t\t我们一起见证了社区花园的建立。","We should support those who are carrying out reforms.\t\t我们应该支持那些在改革的人。","We are on strike because the government has broken its promise.\t\t我们罢工因为政府违背了承诺。","We absolutely have to talk to the boss.\t\t我们非要找领导谈谈不可。","I decided to donate money because many stray dogs need help.\t\t我决定捐款，因为很多流浪狗需要帮助。","I think our community is very united, everyone helps each other.\t\t我觉得我们的社区非常团结，每个人都互相帮助。","I think donating money can help more people who need help.\t\t我觉得捐款能帮助更多需要帮助的人。","I insist on telling him the facts.\t\t我非要告诉他事实不可。","improve safety\t\t提高安全","The government's actions went against earlier promises.\t\t政府的做法违背了之前的承诺。","a just choice\t\t正义的选择","official statement\t\t正式声明","stray dog protection organization\t\t流浪狗保护组织","charity sale\t\t爱心义卖","community charity sale\t\t社区义卖","community charity sale venue\t\t社区义卖场所","community charity sale booth\t\t社区义卖摊位","The residents of the community decided to act together to improve the environment.\t\t社区的居民决定一起行动，改善环境。","arrangements for order\t\t秩序安排","the importance of order\t\t秩序的重要性","orderly\t\t秩序良好","orderly management\t\t管理秩序","online platform for charity sales\t\t线上义卖平台","organizational order\t\t组织秩序","give stray dogs food\t\t给流浪狗食物","maintain security\t\t维护安全","uphold justice\t\t维护正义","joint statement\t\t联合声明","voluntarily join the team\t\t自发加入团队","participate in activities of one's own accord\t\t自发参与活动","spontaneously help others\t\t自发帮助他人","voluntarily contribute time\t\t自发贡献时间","We must attend this meeting.\t\t这个会议我们非参加不可。","We must give this method a try.\t\t这个办法我们非试一试不可。","This organization has been working hard to reform the education system.\t\t这个组织一直在努力改革教育体系。","We must solve this problem.\t\t这个问题我们非解决不可。","These ridiculous rules completely defy common sense.\t\t这些搞笑的规定完全违背了常识。","This practice goes against my principles.\t\t这种做法违背了我的原则。","pursue safety\t\t追求安全","Facing challenges, we must unite.\t\t面对挑战，我们非团结起来不可。","adopt stray dogs\t\t领养流浪狗"]],
  ["Health: Share health concerns",["To increase immunity, we should eat more vegetables and fruits and not be picky about food.\t\t为了增强免疫力，我们应该多吃蔬菜水果，不要挑食。","They say this year's flu is especially contagious.\t\t他们说今年的流感特别容易传染。","the bacteria inside the wound\t\t伤口里的细菌","After you sprained your finger, did you go see a doctor?\t\t你扭伤手指以后，有没有去看医生？","Have you noticed that the wound has started to become inflamed?\t\t你有没有发现伤口开始发炎了？","Have you ever had the flu?\t\t你有没有被流感传染过？","Do you know how the flu is transmitted?\t\t你知道流感是怎么传染的吗？","When it's inflamed, where do you feel the most uncomfortable?\t\t你觉得发炎的时候，哪里最不舒服？","What foods do you think make people pass gas?\t\t你觉得哪些食物会让人放屁？","Do you think emotional numbness will affect treatment effectiveness?\t\t你觉得情绪麻木会影响治疗效果吗？","Do you think the flu will very easily spread to family members?\t\t你觉得流感会不会很容易传染给家人？","Do you think you can really relax?\t\t你觉得自己真的能放松下来吗？","Do you think exercising really can improve immunity?\t\t你觉得锻炼身体真的可以提高免疫力吗？","Do you think that if you control your diet well, you can lower the risk of diabetes?\t\t你认为如果控制好饮食，就能降低糖尿病风险吗？","Do you still want to keep chatting?\t\t你还要聊下去吗？","constipation causes\t\t便秘原因","The doctor told me I need to take pills three times a day.\t\t医生告诉我需要每天吃三次药片。","The doctor said I strained my calf muscle, I was really surprised.\t\t医生说我拉伤了小腿肌肉，我感到很意外。","Doctor, do you think prolonged low mood will affect physical health?\t\t医生，您认为长期消沉会影响身体健康吗？","Doctor, have you ever encountered a patient like me with long-term numbness?\t\t医生，您遇到过像我这样长期麻木的患者吗？","After she sprained her finger, she immediately told her parents.\t\t她扭伤手指后立刻告诉了家长。","If I keep feeling down, should I consider getting counseling?\t\t如果一直消沉，我应该考虑接受心理咨询吗？","If you forget to take antibiotics, what should you do?\t\t如果你忘记吃抗生素，应该怎么办？","If the situation continues, what should I do?\t\t如果情况继续下去，我应该怎么办？","If I forget to take my pills, Dad will remind me.\t\t如果我忘了吃药片，爸爸会提醒我。","After hearing my explanation, Mom calmed down.\t\t妈妈听我解释以后，情绪缓和了下来。","family medicine clinic\t\t家庭诊所","I don't understand why I pulled a muscle so easily.\t\t我不明白为什么这么容易就拉伤了肌肉。","I notice my stomach hurts whenever I drink milk.\t\t我发现每次喝牛奶后肚子都会痛。","After I finish eating spicy food, my stomach hurts a lot.\t\t我吃完辣的东西后，肚子就很痛。","I am worried that my child might get the flu.\t\t我担心我的孩子可能会得流感。","I was very scared at first, then I gradually calmed down.\t\t我本来很害怕，后来情绪慢慢稳定下来。","I eat vegetables every day, but I still get constipated.\t\t我每天都吃蔬菜，可是仍然会便秘。","I know taking pills is very important for treatment, so I am very cooperative.\t\t我知道吃药片对治疗很重要，所以我很配合。","antibiotic therapy\t\t抗生素治疗","control of the diabetic diet\t\t控制糖尿病饮食","boost immunity\t\t提高免疫力","Recently I have found that I often pass gas, and I feel somewhat embarrassed.\t\t最近我发现自己经常放屁，感觉有些尴尬。","Lately I have been passing gas more often than before.\t\t最近我放屁的次数比以前多了。","rational analysis\t\t理智分析","rational judgment\t\t理智判断","rational thinking\t\t理智思考","rational judgment\t\t理智的判断","rational choice\t\t理智选择","lack rationality\t\t缺乏理智","the clinic's nurse\t\t诊所的护士","clinic entrance\t\t诊所门口","This situation cannot continue any longer.\t\t这种情况不能再继续下去了。","prevent diabetes\t\t预防糖尿病","prevent bacterial spread\t\t预防细菌传播","hypertension screening\t\t高血压检查","hypertension treatment\t\t高血压治疗","hypertension medication\t\t高血压药物","hypertension risk\t\t高血压风险"]],
  ["Cooking: Explain how to marinate meat",["There is no production date printed on it.\t\t上面没有印生产日期。","do not add MSG\t\t不放味精","traditional uses of spices\t\t传统香料用法","Do you sprinkle cheese when you make pasta?\t\t你做意大利面会撒芝士吗？","Are you ready to try a new gelatin dessert recipe?\t\t你准备好尝试新的果冻做法了吗？","Do you like the smell of coconut?\t\t你喜欢椰子的香味吗？","Do you usually sprinkle spices in soup?\t\t你平时会在汤里撒香料吗？","Have you ever tried using coconut to make dessert?\t\t你有没有尝试过用椰子做甜品？","Have you ever tried carving letters on a cake?\t\t你有没有试过在蛋糕上刻字母？","Do you know when you should add MSG?\t\t你知道什么时候应该放味精吗？","Do you know how long to marinate pork?\t\t你知道应该腌猪肉多长时间吗？","Do you think MSG affects health?\t\t你觉得味精对健康有影响吗？","What pretty flowers do you think I can carve on the cookies?\t\t你觉得我可以在饼干上刻什么好看的花？","What do you think of coconut with chocolate?\t\t你觉得椰子和巧克力搭配起来怎么样？","Do you think using MSG will affect health?\t\t你觉得用味精会影响健康吗？","How long do you think it takes to marinate tofu?\t\t你认为腌豆腐需要多长时间呢？","First, scoop out the contents.\t\t先把里面的东西盛出来。","Pictures of spices are printed on the packaging.\t\t包装上印了香料的图片。","The production date is printed on the packaging.\t\t包装上印有生产日期。","The chef used a knife to carve exquisite patterns on the chocolate.\t\t厨师用刀在巧克力上刻出精致的图案。","Chefs usually choose fresh pork belly to ensure texture.\t\t厨师通常会选择新鲜的五花肉来保证口感。","various spice combinations\t\t各种香料组合","MSG and soy sauce\t\t味精和酱油","If you like mild flavors, you can just dip in soy sauce.\t\t如果你喜欢清淡口味，可以只蘸酱油。","If you use the right amount of cilantro, the flavor will be richer.\t\t如果你用适量的香菜，味道会更丰富。","If there are no spices, this dish will be very bland.\t\t如果没有香料，这道菜会很单调。","the taste of home cooking\t\t家常口味","home style eggplant\t\t家常茄子","colorful jello\t\t彩色果冻","We first need to prepare a fresh coconut.\t\t我们首先需要准备一个新鲜的椰子。","I like to sprinkle some ground pepper into the soup.\t\t我喜欢在汤里撒一些胡椒粉。","I got the name wrong!\t\t我把名字标错了！","Every time I eat barbecue, I like to dip in two different sauces.\t\t我每次吃烧烤都喜欢蘸两种不同的酱。","I need a soup ladle.\t\t我需要一个能盛汤的勺子。","Add the seasonings to taste\t\t放适量配料","fresh spices\t\t新鲜的香料","Last night I sprinkled a lot of herbs on the pizza.\t\t昨晚我在披萨上撒了很多香草。","The price is marked on the label.\t\t标签上标有价格。","There is no production date marked on the label.\t\t标签上没有标生产日期。","coconut cream sauce\t\t椰子奶油酱","deep-fried eggplant\t\t油炸茄子","mix various spices\t\t混合多种香料","cinnamon spice blend\t\t混合肉桂香料","beef rice noodle soup\t\t牛肉米粉汤","Instructions for use are printed on the bottle.\t\t瓶子上印有使用说明。","use fish sauce to stir fry\t\t用鱼露炒菜","The box has storage instructions written on it.\t\t盒子上写有保存方法。","Give me a bowl of water.\t\t给我盛一碗水。","The teacher suggested we carve some unique designs on the cake.\t\t老师建议我们在蛋糕上刻一些独特的图形。","cinnamon chocolate cake\t\t肉桂巧克力蛋糕","cinnamon honey tea\t\t肉桂蜂蜜茶","crisp-tender bean sprouts\t\t脆嫩豆芽","bean sprout hot pot\t\t豆芽火锅","stir-fried beef with bean sprouts\t\t豆芽炒牛肉","stir-fried bean sprouts with eggs\t\t豆芽炒鸡蛋","bean sprout rice noodles\t\t豆芽米粉","an appropriate amount of salt\t\t适量的盐","vanilla to taste\t\t适量香草","crispy texture\t\t酥脆口感","crunchy chocolate\t\t酥脆巧克力","flaky and crisp dessert\t\t酥脆甜点","crispy cookies\t\t酥脆的饼干","crispy potato chips\t\t酥脆薯片","crusty bread\t\t酥脆面包","There is a lot of information printed on the spice packaging.\t\t香料包装上印有很多信息。","sesame oil and soy sauce\t\t香油和酱油","beef marinated in sesame oil\t\t香油腌牛肉","sesame oil dipping sauce\t\t香油蘸酱","spicy pork belly\t\t香辣五花肉","fish sauce soup base\t\t鱼露汤底","fish sauce dip\t\t鱼露蘸酱","fish sauce with rice noodles\t\t鱼露配米粉","numbing and spicy rice noodle soup\t\t麻辣米粉汤"]],
  ["Business: Negotiate a business deal",["Why do you think it is very hard for us to cooperate?\t\t为什么你觉得我们很难达成合作？","talent development plan\t\t人才培养计划","talent market development\t\t人才市场发展","warehouse management system\t\t仓库管理系统","warehouse transportation process\t\t仓库运输流程","They not only sell products, but also provide after-sales service.\t\t他们不仅销售产品，还提供售后服务。","We started shipping only after they paid the deposit.\t\t他们支付了定金后，我们才开始发货。","depressed prices\t\t价格低迷","outstanding talent recruitment\t\t优秀人才招聘","weak market sentiment\t\t低迷的市场氛围","Why did you choose to develop this special plastic first?\t\t你们为什么选择先研发这种特殊的塑料？","Can you briefly introduce the global procurement process?\t\t你可以介绍一下全球采购流程吗？","Have you ever thought about working in the e-commerce industry?\t\t你有没有想过在电子商务行业工作？","Have you ever considered working at an e-commerce company?\t\t你有没有考虑过在电子商务公司工作？","Do you think we can reach a consensus today?\t\t你觉得我们今天能达成共识吗？","promote job growth\t\t促进就业发展","maintain close contact\t\t保持紧密联系","ensure efficiency\t\t保证效率","global raw materials\t\t全球原材料","global partners\t\t全球合作伙伴","global market\t\t全球市场","global e-commerce\t\t全球电子商务","regional alliance cooperation\t\t区域联盟合作","raw material cost\t\t原材料成本","raw materials testing\t\t原材料检测","Both sides were willing to make concessions, so they quickly reached an agreement.\t\t双方都愿意让步，所以很快达成了协议。","Once the customer completes payment, we will begin shipping.\t\t只要客户完成支付，我们就开始发货。","renewable raw materials\t\t可再生原材料","contract contents\t\t合约内容","contract term\t\t合约期限","attract international talent\t\t吸引国际人才","increase regional employment\t\t增加地区就业","increase efficiency\t\t增加效率","She suggested we analyze global market demand.\t\t她建议我们分析全球市场的需求。","If R&D is successful, we can start mass production.\t\t如果研发成功，我们就可以开始大规模生产。","job market demand\t\t就业市场需求","extensive cooperation\t\t广泛合作","conduct business extensively\t\t广泛开展业务","broad market\t\t广泛的市场","extensive sales network\t\t广泛的销售网络","widely sold\t\t广泛销售","establish close cooperation\t\t建立紧密合作","form a new alliance\t\t成立新联盟","Our company specializes in researching and developing new materials that comply with environmental protection standards.\t\t我们公司专门研发符合环保标准的新型材料。","We discussed the details of the contract yesterday.\t\t我们昨天讨论了合约的细节。","We purchase different raw materials each month.\t\t我们每个月都会采购不同的原材料。","We purchase different raw materials each week.\t\t我们每周都会采购不同的原材料。","The client and I spent several hours before reaching a consensus.\t\t我和客户花了几个小时才达成一致意见。","I am responsible for selling products at an international company.\t\t我在一家国际公司负责销售产品。","After graduating, my older sister wants to work for a multinational company.\t\t我姐姐毕业后想进入跨国公司工作。","I have paid the full amount, but I still have not received the invoice.\t\t我支付了全部费用，但还没有收到发票。","After I receive the contract, I will get back to you as soon as possible!\t\t我收到合约后会尽快回复你！","My team is analyzing global logistics data.\t\t我的团队正在分析全球的物流数据。","I think the members of the alliance should support each other.\t\t我认为联盟的成员应该互相支持。","expand rural employment\t\t扩大农村就业","provide jobs\t\t提供就业岗位","efficiency first\t\t效率优先","productivity tools\t\t效率工具","Recently, the economies of many countries have been rather sluggish.\t\t最近很多国家的经济都比较低迷。","services and trade\t\t服务业与贸易","service sector market\t\t服务业市场","the importance of the service sector\t\t服务业的重要性","e-commerce company\t\t电子商务公司","e-commerce platform\t\t电子商务平台","e-commerce services\t\t电子商务服务","e-commerce website\t\t电子商务网站","e-commerce sales\t\t电子商务销售","close cooperation\t\t紧密合作","unite closely\t\t紧密团结","close communication\t\t紧密沟通","close ties\t\t紧密联系","a period of economic downturn\t\t经济低迷时期","internal communication within the alliance\t\t联盟内部交流","relations within the alliance\t\t联盟内部关系","the alliance's goals\t\t联盟的目标","Regarding whether the product fits local culture, the company has already conducted a survey.\t\t至于产品符不符合当地文化，公司已经做了调查。","When it comes to the quality of after-sales service, customer feedback is very important.\t\t至于售后服务好不好，客户反馈很重要。","As for who will be responsible for quality testing, the company has already set up a dedicated team.\t\t至于谁来负责质量检测，公司已经安排了专门团队。","As for who is responsible for procurement, the manager has not yet decided.\t\t至于谁负责采购，经理还没有决定。","multinational company products\t\t跨国公司产品","multinational company warehouse\t\t跨国公司仓库","multinational company employees\t\t跨国公司员工","market for multinational corporations\t\t跨国公司市场","imported raw materials\t\t进口原材料","pursue efficiency\t\t追求效率","select raw materials\t\t选择原材料","financial services industry\t\t金融服务业"]],
  ["Safety: Ask about safety precautions",["A puppy ran toward me, I hit the brakes at once.\t\t一只小狗朝我跑过来，我赶紧刹车。","A puppy is hiding behind the bridge.\t\t一只小狗躲在桥后面。","traffic warning sign\t\t交通警示牌","He said he felt a little dizzy.\t\t他说自己有点头昏。","an experience that leaves you scared afterward\t\t令人后怕的经历","Don't forget, after you get through this rough patch, life will get better.\t\t你别忘了，扛过这段时间后生活会变得更好。","Have you ever been scared because someone suddenly passed you?\t\t你曾经因为别人突然超车而感到害怕吗？","Has your mood gotten any better lately?\t\t你最近的心情有没有好转？","Have you checked the highway traffic conditions?\t\t你有没有查看高速公路的路况信息？","Did you notice the icy patches on the road?\t\t你有没有注意到马路上结冰的地方？","Do you think this accident was caused by brake failure?\t\t你觉得这次事故是因为刹车失灵吗？","child seat belt\t\t儿童安全带","After the accident, that driver fainted.\t\t出事了以后，那位司机昏过去了。","He just fainted, now he is finally awake.\t\t刚才他昏过去了，现在终于醒了。","warning sign for construction ahead\t\t前方施工警示牌","I dodged past that rock up ahead.\t\t前面那块石头我躲过去了。","occupying a lane\t\t占用车道","As long as you have patience, life is sure to gradually turn for the better.\t\t只要有耐心，生活一定会慢慢好转。","Drivers should pay attention to those warning signs to avoid accidents.\t\t司机们应该注意那些警示牌，以免发生意外。","The driver loudly reminded everyone to fasten their seat belts properly.\t\t司机大声提醒大家要系好安全带。","She fainted after calling the police.\t\t她报警后昏了过去。","After she fell off her bicycle, her forehead swelled up.\t\t她骑自行车摔倒后，额头肿起来了。","If you feel shaken after a traffic accident, please talk with friends.\t\t如果你因为交通事故感到后怕，请和朋友聊聊。","If you feel it hurts too much, then do not endure it, you should tell the doctor.\t\t如果你觉得太疼，就不要忍，应该告诉医生。","If the injury is very minor, would you choose to endure it for a bit or handle it immediately?\t\t如果受伤很轻，你会选择忍一下还是马上处理？","If the driver had reminded everyone at the time to fasten their seat belts, the situation might have been different.\t\t如果司机当时提醒大家系好安全带，情况也许会不同。","If your forehead swells up, how would you handle it?\t\t如果额头肿起来，你会怎么处理？","Mom said the broken umbrella can't be used anymore.\t\t妈妈说，破的雨伞不能再用了。","Recently, my mood has finally started to improve.\t\t我最近的心情终于开始好转了。","My friend illegally passed on the highway and was fined.\t\t我朋友在高速公路上违规超车，被罚款了。","I smiled a little at the police officer.\t\t我朝警察笑了笑。","I'm okay, just dizzy.\t\t我没事，就是头昏。","I saw that car's brakes suddenly fail.\t\t我看到那辆车的刹车突然失灵了。","I quickly dodged to the right.\t\t我赶紧往右边躲了一下。","wrist strength\t\t手腕力量","wrist injury\t\t手腕受伤","relax the wrist\t\t手腕放松","sore wrist\t\t手腕酸痛","Last night the temperature was very low, the street had already iced over.\t\t昨天夜里气温很低，马路已经结冰了。","Yesterday at the intersection I saw two cars crash.\t\t昨天我在路口看到两辆车发生了碰撞。","Last night the temperature was very low, and the parking lot pavement also froze.\t\t昨晚气温很低，停车场的地面也结冰了。","Someone passed out!\t\t有人昏倒了！","check road conditions\t\t查询路况","clear line of sight\t\t清晰的视线","narrow path\t\t狭窄的小路","narrow space\t\t狭窄的空间","narrow lane\t\t狭窄的车道","clothes with holes\t\t破洞的衣服","torn clothes\t\t破衣服","Although he was already safe, Wang Ming still felt very scared afterward.\t\t虽然已经安全了，王明还是觉得很后怕。","line of sight range\t\t视线范围","Is the police officer waving to me?\t\t警察在朝我挥手吗？","traffic information\t\t路况信息","Road conditions are complex\t\t路况复杂","The passenger in the car fainted!\t\t车上的乘客昏过去了！","minor vehicle collision\t\t车辆轻微碰撞","the center of the lane\t\t车道中央","I can get through this!\t\t这件事我可以扛过去！","That person passed out.\t\t那个人昏过去了。","During that period, the pressure was intense, but I told myself to tough it out.\t\t那段时间压力很大，但我告诉自己要扛过去。","That car was so fast, I almost didn't get out of the way!\t\t那辆车好快，我差点儿没躲过去！","That car is coming toward me.\t\t那辆车正在朝我开过来。","block the line of sight\t\t阻挡视线"]],
  ["Countryside: Say why you moved",["rural internet\t\t乡下的互联网","rural creative inspiration\t\t乡村创作灵感","early morning in the countryside\t\t乡村的清晨","They left the city to lessen life's pressures.\t\t他们离开城市，为的是减少生活压力。","They chose country life to be close to nature.\t\t他们选择乡村生活，为的是亲近自然。","traditional artisans\t\t传统手艺人","Why would you choose such a busy lifestyle?\t\t你为什么会选择这样繁忙的生活方式？","Do you hope to escape the bustle of the city and return to your hometown?\t\t你希望逃离都市的繁忙，回到家乡吗？","Have you ever felt lost because there were too many choices?\t\t你曾经因为选择太多而变得迷茫吗？","Are you interested in work related to environmental protection?\t\t你有没有兴趣从事和环保相关的工作？","Have you ever longed to leave your hometown and experience urban life?\t\t你有没有向往过离开家乡，体验都市的生活？","What did you leave your hometown for?\t\t你离开家乡为的是什么？","What challenges do you think you will encounter working in the countryside?\t\t你觉得在乡村工作会遇到哪些挑战？","Do you think doing part-time work really can help us understand the world?\t\t你觉得打工真的能帮助我们了解世界吗？","Do you think sacrificing personal time is worth it?\t\t你觉得牺牲个人时间值得吗？","jointly participate in creation\t\t共同参与创作","space for creative freedom\t\t创作自由空间","creative process sharing\t\t创作过程分享","creative artisan\t\t创意手艺人","go work at a construction site\t\t去工地打工","regional per capita expenditure\t\t地区人均支出","urban construction site life\t\t城市工地生活","urban food service work\t\t城市餐饮工作","urban food and beverage services\t\t城市餐饮服务","To help her younger brother attend school, she had to forgo part of her own income.\t\t她为了帮助弟弟上学，不得不牺牲自己的一部分收入。","She believes the pace of life in the countryside is slower than in the city and more suitable for creating.\t\t她认为乡下的生活节奏比城市慢，更适合创作。","She resigned for the sake of her own mental health.\t\t她辞职为的是自己的心理健康。","If I lived in a big city, I would keep striving in my career.\t\t如果我住在大城市，我会为了事业不断奋斗。","Many people move to the countryside to be close to nature.\t\t很多人搬到农村，为的是靠近大自然。","Many people think the digital nomad lifestyle is slowly becoming popular in rural areas.\t\t很多人觉得数字游民的生活方式正在农村慢慢流行起来。","Many rural young people long to go to big cities to work and live.\t\t很多农村青年向往去大城市工作和生活。","Many young people from the countryside find city life very busy.\t\t很多来自农村的青年觉得城市生活非常繁忙。","We moved to the countryside to be closer to nature.\t\t我们搬到乡下，为的是能更亲近自然。","Every week, we help our neighbors rebuild the small bridge that was destroyed by the flood.\t\t我们每周都在帮助邻居重建被洪水毁坏的小桥。","My older brother plans to go to Shanghai to work this year, because he wants to learn about different lifestyles.\t\t我哥哥打算今年去上海打工，因为他想了解不同的生活方式。","I like the unhurried rural life because the pace there is very slow.\t\t我喜欢乡村的悠闲生活，因为那里的节奏很慢。","I keep striving in the countryside because I love nature.\t\t我坚持在农村奋斗，因为我热爱大自然。","I plan to work in education after I graduate because I like helping others.\t\t我打算毕业后从事教育工作，因为我喜欢帮助别人。","After my friend moved to the countryside, every day has been very leisurely and at ease.\t\t我朋友搬到农村后，每天都过得很悠闲和自在。","I think living in the city makes me more motivated to work hard.\t\t我认为在城市生活让我更有动力去奋斗。","I know an artisan who makes furniture from bamboo.\t\t我认识一位手艺人，他用竹子制作家具。","artisans' exchange event\t\t手艺人交流会","an artisan's life\t\t手艺人生活","artisan's workshop\t\t手艺人的工作室","ways digital nomads work\t\t数字游民工作方式","digital nomads' freedom\t\t数字游民的自由","a new generation of digital nomads\t\t新一代数字游民","Digital nomads have been especially popular recently.\t\t最近特别流行数字游民。","Some people leave big cities to reduce stress.\t\t有些人离开大城市，为的是减少压力。","independent artisan\t\t独立手艺人","busy city life\t\t繁忙的都市生活","free digital nomads\t\t自由的数字游民","Although per capita income is high in cities, spending pressure is also high.\t\t虽然城市人均收入高，但是消费压力也大。","engage in creative activities\t\t进行创作活动","urban dreams\t\t都市梦想","international youth exchange\t\t青年国际交流","youth self-actualization\t\t青年自我实现","facing uncertainty\t\t面对迷茫","dining culture experience\t\t餐饮文化体验","food and beverage spending level\t\t餐饮消费水平","food and beverage management experience\t\t餐饮管理经验"]],
  ["Clothing: Share tips for getting good deals",["Even if the book is expensive, the content is very useful.\t\t书贵就贵吧，内容很有用。","Why do you like to wear sweatshirts in the spring?\t\t你为什么喜欢在春天穿卫衣？","Do you like the gold-colored buttons on this pair of shoes?\t\t你喜欢这双鞋上的金色纽扣吗？","Do you like this store's new leather bags?\t\t你喜欢这家店新款的皮包吗？","That necklace you chose yesterday suits you very well!\t\t你昨天挑选的那条项链非常适合你！","Have you ever bought a tank top and found that it did not match the pictures?\t\t你有没有买过背心，发现和图片不符的情况？","Have you ever tried on this pair of blue slippers?\t\t你有没有试穿过这双蓝色拖鞋？","Have you tried on this pair of blue slippers?\t\t你有没有试穿这双蓝色拖鞋？","Do you know which pattern is popular this year?\t\t你知道今年流行哪种花纹吗？","Can you tell if this watch is genuine?\t\t你能确定这款手表是正品吗？","Which bag do you think is the better choice?\t\t你觉得挑选哪款包包更合适？","Do you think this leather bag suits men or women?\t\t你觉得这个皮包适合男士还是女士？","Do you think this vest is too big?\t\t你觉得这件背心是不是太大了？","well-fitting shoes\t\t合脚的鞋子","well-fitting tank top\t\t合身的背心","The salesperson at the mall said I could not bargain, but I still gave it a shot.\t\t商场的售货员说不可以砍价，但我还是试了一下。","various styles\t\t多种款式","women's sleeveless jacket\t\t女士无袖外套","She always picks scarves with ethnic patterns.\t\t她总是挑选有民族花纹的围巾。","If you cannot haggle, you might have to pay a bit more.\t\t如果你不会砍价，可能就要多花一些钱。","If you want to ensure quality, you should choose genuine products.\t\t如果你想保证质量，应该选择正品。","If I buy cheap underwear, I may need to buy new ones again very soon.\t\t如果我买便宜的内衣，可能需要很快再买新的。","If I wear extra large pants, will they be too loose?\t\t如果我穿加大号的裤子，会不会太宽松？","If there is an extra large size, I will choose this shirt.\t\t如果有加大号，我会选择这件衬衫。","If the waistband is too tight, I feel uncomfortable wearing it.\t\t如果腰围太紧，我穿起来会觉得不舒服。","Mom always helps me choose the softest clothes.\t\t妈妈总是帮我挑选最柔软的衣服。","Mom spent a long time picking out the right leather purse.\t\t妈妈花了很长时间挑选合适的皮包。","Mom says this style of shoe is pretty comfortable.\t\t妈妈说这个款式的鞋子比较舒服。","affordable underwear\t\t实惠的内衣","loose sweatshirt\t\t宽松卫衣","loose waistline\t\t宽松的腰围","colored buttons\t\t彩色纽扣","I noticed the pattern on her shirt was very distinctive.\t\t我发现她的衬衫花纹很独特。","At the store, I saw that slippers were on sale, so I bought two pairs.\t\t我在商店看到拖鞋正在打折，就买了两双。","My mom especially likes clothes with ethnic patterns.\t\t我妈妈特别喜欢有民族花纹的衣服。","I'd rather pay extra for the real thing than take a risk.\t\t我宁愿多花钱买正品，也不想冒险。","I really like that blue short-sleeved shirt, but it costs twice as much as the white one.\t\t我很喜欢那件蓝色的短袖，但它比白色的贵一倍。","I want to know whether this T-shirt has an extra-large size.\t\t我想知道这件T恤有没有加大号。","I want a brightly colored turtleneck sweater.\t\t我想要一件颜色鲜艳的高领毛衣。","I noticed that waist sizing varies by brand.\t\t我注意到不同品牌的腰围标准不一样。","I think this shirt has a very distinctive pattern.\t\t我觉得这件衬衫的花纹很独特。","I think the style of this dress is very original.\t\t我觉得这件裙子的款式很新颖。","slipper area\t\t拖鞋区","newly bought shoes\t\t新买的鞋子","new sandals\t\t新款凉鞋","new sweatshirt\t\t新款卫衣","new style leather bag\t\t新款皮包","new trench coat\t\t新的风衣","sleeveless top\t\t无袖上衣","Since you like that expensive short-sleeved shirt, just buy it!\t\t既然你喜欢那件贵的短袖，就买下来吧！","fashionable styles\t\t时尚款式","soft pants\t\t柔软的裤子","jeans button\t\t牛仔裤纽扣","unique pattern\t\t独特的花纹","pearl button\t\t珍珠纽扣","The computer can be expensive, as long as it is convenient to use.\t\t电脑贵就贵吧，用起来方便就好。","men's sandals\t\t男士凉鞋","white sandals\t\t白色凉鞋","genuine leather bag\t\t真皮皮包","the price of short-sleeved shirts\t\t短袖的价格","comfortable short-sleeved top\t\t舒适的短袖","Although this sweatshirt is cheap, the quality is good too.\t\t虽然这件卫衣便宜，但质量也不错。","If the socks have gotten thin, they have gotten thin, it does not matter.\t\t袜子薄了就薄了，没关系。","the pants' pattern\t\t裤子的花纹","The pants are long, there is nothing to worry about.\t\t裤子长了就长了，没有什么可担心的。","Excuse me, do these sneakers come in other styles?\t\t请问这双运动鞋还有其他款式吗？","Excuse me, does this style come in other colors?\t\t请问这款式还有其他颜色吗？","Even if this house is expensive, the surroundings are beautiful.\t\t这个房子贵就贵吧，环境优美。","Sure, this hotel is expensive, but the service is first-rate.\t\t这个酒店贵就贵吧，服务一流。","These earrings are old, and that is okay.\t\t这些耳环旧了就旧了，没关系。","These earrings are heavy, no problem.\t\t这些耳环重了就重了，没关系。","These socks are short, no big deal.\t\t这些袜子短了就短了，没关系。","this trench coat\t\t这件风衣","The color of this turtleneck sweater is very bright, I really like it.\t\t这件高领毛衣颜色很亮，我很喜欢。","Choose genuine products\t\t选择正品","that trench coat\t\t那件风衣","turtleneck sweatshirt\t\t高领卫衣","turtleneck shirt\t\t高领衬衫","black tank top\t\t黑色的背心"]],
  ["Globalization: Spot global brands nearby",["Some countries need more skilled labor.\t\t一些国家需要更多技术劳动力。","If we do not improve our technology, we are bound to fail.\t\t不提高技术，我们非失败不可。","If we do not lower prices, we are bound to lose customers.\t\t不降低价格，我们非失去客户不可。","All the countries of the world are facing the problem of resource scarcity.\t\t世界各国都面临着资源短缺的问题。","China's factories process large quantities of raw materials every day.\t\t中国的工厂每天都在加工大量原材料。","abundant labor force\t\t丰富的劳动力","They were affected by the earthquake, and life has become very difficult.\t\t他们因为地震受灾，生活变得非常困难。","Last year, their hometown was devastated by an earthquake.\t\t他们的家乡去年因为地震严重受灾。","enterprise competitiveness\t\t企业竞争力","excellent quality\t\t优秀的素质","Would you be willing to protect the environment of this community with me?\t\t你愿意和我一起守护这个社区的环境吗？","Have you ever worried that local brands would lose customers?\t\t你有没有担心过本地品牌会失去顾客？","Have you considered these new opportunities?\t\t你有没有考虑过这些新的机遇？","Do you know which enterprises specialize in processing agricultural products?\t\t你知道哪些企业专门加工农产品吗？","Which industries do you think will be affected by water scarcity?\t\t你认为水资源短缺会影响哪些行业？","global labor market\t\t全球劳动力市场","global competitiveness\t\t全球竞争力","agricultural product prices\t\t农产品价格","trade in agricultural products\t\t农产品贸易","impacts and challenges\t\t冲击与挑战","agricultural products for export\t\t出口农产品","Trade between South Africa and China\t\t南非与中国贸易","South Africa's economic development\t\t南非经济发展","trade partner of south africa\t\t南非贸易伙伴","raw material shortage\t\t原材料短缺","development opportunities\t\t发展机遇","develop competitiveness\t\t发展竞争力","trend toward internationalization\t\t国际化发展趋势","global market demand\t\t国际化市场需求","Internationalization makes cities more open, and it also lets me make friends from different countries.\t\t国际化让城市变得更开放，也让我能认识不同国家的朋友。","international competitiveness\t\t国际竞争力","increase opportunities\t\t增加机遇","multicultural literacy\t\t多元文化素质","extensive communication\t\t大量交流","exchange of large amounts of information\t\t大量信息交流","extensive cooperation\t\t大量合作","many jobs\t\t大量就业岗位","She believes that studying foreign languages can enhance personal competitiveness.\t\t她认为学习外语能提高个人的竞争力。","The work she is responsible for involves communication with foreign clients.\t\t她负责的工作涉及与外国客户的交流。","If companies do not adapt to new changes, they may lose customers.\t\t如果企业不适应新变化，它们可能会失去顾客。","If your decision involves others' interests, what would you do?\t\t如果你的决定涉及他人利益，你会怎么做？","If the raw materials are processed locally, will costs be reduced?\t\t如果原材料在本地加工，成本会降低吗？","If you want to buy foreign products, I suggest placing an order on a reliable website, it is safer.\t\t如果想买外国商品，我建议你在可靠的网站下单，这样更安全。","Without the United Nations, many problems would be impossible to solve.\t\t如果没有联合国，很多问题会无法解决。","seek assistance\t\t寻求援助","market shock\t\t市场冲击","market competitiveness\t\t市场竞争力","Many countries have provided emergency aid to disaster-affected areas.\t\t很多国家向受灾地区提供了紧急援助。","Many countries have been affected by flooding and need international assistance.\t\t很多国家因为洪水受灾，需要国际帮助。","Each of us has a responsibility to protect the environment and reduce pollution.\t\t我们每个人都有责任守护环境，减少污染。","I have noticed that my city has become more open, and people are willing to accept foreign culture now.\t\t我发现我的城市变得更加开放，大家愿意接受外国文化了。","I’ve noticed that more and more people now like ordering foreign products online.\t\t我发现现在越来越多人喜欢在网上下单购买外国商品。","My coworker orders coffee online every day and says it saves a lot of time.\t\t我的同事每天都在网上下单咖啡，说这样节省了很多时间。","I believe that innovation can enhance our competitiveness.\t\t我相信创新可以增强我们的竞争力。","I think my city has become even more open because of globalization.\t\t我觉得我的城市因为全球化变得更加开放了。","I think an open environment makes it easier for people to accept different values.\t\t我认为开放的环境让人们更容易接受不同的价值观。","development of technical competence\t\t技术素质发展","seize the opportunity\t\t抓住机遇","expand qualities and abilities\t\t拓展素质能力","provide assistance\t\t提供援助","provide opportunities\t\t提供机遇","boost corporate competitiveness\t\t提高企业竞争力","aid operation\t\t援助行动","the internationalization of education\t\t教育的国际化","culture shock\t\t文化冲击","new opportunities\t\t新的机遇","New Zealand brand store\t\t新西兰品牌店","New Zealand wool products\t\t新西兰羊毛商品","New Zealand art exchange\t\t新西兰艺术交流","environmental impact\t\t环境冲击","The current workforce can go to different countries to work.\t\t现在的劳动力可以去不同国家工作。","sudden impact\t\t突然的冲击","quality and ability\t\t素质与能力","development of quality-oriented education\t\t素质教育发展","emergency assistance\t\t紧急援助","economic competitiveness\t\t经济竞争力","green agricultural products\t\t绿色农产品","professionalism training\t\t职业素质培训","United Nations Headquarters\t\t联合国总部","The United Nations meets every year to discuss global challenges.\t\t联合国每年都会开会讨论全球的挑战。","United Nations organization\t\t联合国组织","The United Nations encourages all members to seek solutions together.\t\t联合国鼓励所有成员一起寻找解决方案。","a tough challenge\t\t艰苦的挑战","harsh conditions\t\t艰苦的条件","harsh environment\t\t艰苦的环境","a hard life\t\t艰苦的生活","arduous process\t\t艰苦的过程","This proposal must be agreed upon by all five countries.\t\t这个提议非五个国家都同意不可。","This plan has to be carried out by that French company.\t\t这个方案非那家法国公司做不可。","This project must be handled by their organization.\t\t这个项目非他们机构负责不可。","enter the Argentine market\t\t进入阿根廷市场","Argentine products\t\t阿根廷产品","Argentine company investment\t\t阿根廷公司投资","argentine beef exports\t\t阿根廷牛肉出口","a rare opportunity\t\t难得的机遇"]],
  ["Ingredients: Describe salad ingredients",["one spoonful of olive oil\t\t一勺橄榄油","one stalk of celery\t\t一根芹菜","one bowl of broth\t\t一碗高汤","He steamed the rice until it was cooked.\t\t他把米饭蒸熟。","First, mix the flour and water well.\t\t你先把面粉和水混合好。","What dishes do you like to stew?\t\t你喜欢炖什么菜呢？","Do you want to learn how to stew lamb?\t\t你想不想学会怎么炖羊肉？","Have you ever tried frying a steak in a pan?\t\t你有没有试过用平底锅煎牛排？","Have you ever tried soaking bread in milk to make dessert?\t\t你有没有试过用牛奶泡面包做甜点？","Have you ever tried stewing tofu at home yourself?\t\t你有没有试过自己在家炖豆腐？","Do you know why we have to rinse ingredients?\t\t你知道为什么我们要冲洗食材吗？","Do you know why glutinous rice is suitable for making desserts?\t\t你知道为什么糯米适合做甜点吗？","Can you help me prepare a few slices of onion?\t\t你能帮我准备几片洋葱吗？","Can you help me stir these ingredients?\t\t你能帮我搅拌这些配料吗？","Do you think such a simple approach is convenient?\t\t你觉得这样的简易做法方便吗？","Do you think this slice of carrot is too thick?\t\t你觉得这片胡萝卜太厚了吗？","When making desserts, brown sugar and milk go well together.\t\t做甜点的时候，红糖和牛奶很搭配。","Cooking this dish ruined my pot.\t\t做这道菜把我的锅弄坏了。","healthy olive oil\t\t健康的橄榄油","Cutting vegetables exhausted me.\t\t切菜把我累死了。","heat the glutinous rice\t\t加热糯米","When she was stirring oil and salt, her movements were very skillful.\t\t她在搅拌油和盐的时候，动作非常熟练。","She boiled the water.\t\t她把水煮开。","Only after she had soaked the glutinous rice did she begin preparing the other ingredients.\t\t她泡好糯米后，才开始准备其他材料。","If you do not like sliced meat, you can use sliced vegetables instead.\t\t如果你不喜欢肉片，也可以用蔬菜片代替。","If there is dirt on the leaves, I will carefully rinse them a few times.\t\t如果叶子上有泥土，我会认真冲洗几遍。","If there is too much flour, the pastry might become very hard.\t\t如果面粉太多，点心可能会变得很硬。","If there is too much flour, the cookies might become very hard.\t\t如果面粉太多，饼干可能会变得很硬。","Mom told me that brown sugar can make desserts taste richer.\t\t妈妈告诉我，红糖可以让点心味道更丰富。","Mom likes to stir-fry vegetables in a frying pan because this way is healthier.\t\t妈妈喜欢用平底锅炒蔬菜，因为这样更健康。","Mom brought the milk to a boil.\t\t妈妈把牛奶煮开。","a little olive oil\t\t少许橄榄油","a little honey\t\t少许蜂蜜","a little cilantro\t\t少许香菜","stir-frying in a frying pan\t\t平底锅炒菜","I accidentally froze the butter solid.\t\t我不小心把黄油冻硬了。","We first prepare the sesame seeds, then start frying the shrimp.\t\t我们先准备好芝麻，再开始炸虾。","We first pour the coconut milk into a big bowl.\t\t我们先把椰奶倒进大碗里。","I like to heat it slowly and let the soup slowly come to a boil.\t\t我喜欢慢慢加热，让汤慢慢沸腾。","I like using olive oil to fry eggs.\t\t我喜欢用橄榄油来煎鸡蛋。","I like to use peanut oil to deep-fry chicken wings.\t\t我喜欢用花生油来炸鸡翅。","I suggest you first rinse all the vegetables clean with plain water.\t\t我建议你先把所有的蔬菜用清水冲洗干净。","I suggest you choose fresh chicken breast to make this dish.\t\t我建议你选择新鲜的鸡胸肉来做这道菜。","As soon as I saw the soup boiling, I quickly put the lid on the pot.\t\t我看到汤沸腾后，就赶紧盖上锅盖。","I usually use stock to stew beef, that way the flavor will be richer.\t\t我通常会用高汤来炖牛肉，这样味道会更丰富。","I usually marinate the chicken first, then deep-fry it.\t\t我通常先把鸡肉腌好再去炸。","sprinkle sesame seeds on top\t\t撒上芝麻","fresh flour\t\t新鲜面粉","Yesterday I made pan-fried chicken breast, and the whole family liked it very much.\t\t昨天我做了香煎鸡胸肉，全家人都很喜欢。","My friends all say that the snacks I made with brown sugar are really tasty!\t\t朋友们都夸我用红糖做的小吃很美味！","coconut milk fruit salad\t\t椰奶水果沙拉","refreshing healthy choice\t\t清爽健康选择","refreshing lemon juice\t\t清爽柠檬汁","a refreshing taste experience\t\t清爽的味觉体验","refreshing lemon juice\t\t清爽的柠檬汁","simple method\t\t简易做法","simple method of making\t\t简易制作方法","simple snacks\t\t简易小吃","easy to operate\t\t简易操作","simple breakfast\t\t简易早餐","simple materials\t\t简易材料","glutinous rice dessert\t\t糯米甜点","celery and carrots\t\t芹菜和胡萝卜","beef stewed with celery\t\t芹菜炖牛肉","Please remember to rinse the carrots before cutting them.\t\t请记得在切胡萝卜之前先冲洗它们。","pan-seared chicken breast\t\t香煎鸡胸肉","chicken stewed in rich broth\t\t高汤炖鸡"]],
  ["Community: Share your project ideas",["professional housekeeping services\t\t专业家政服务","He arranged a picnic so the elderly person could go out for a walk.\t\t他为了让老人出去走走而安排了一次野餐。","They like to take part in local environmental projects, which are convenient and meaningful.\t\t他们喜欢就近参与环保项目，方便又有意义。","They plan to hand out questionnaires before the event.\t\t他们打算在活动前先发放问卷。","excellent nanny\t\t优秀的保姆","Have you filled out our service questionnaire?\t\t你填写过我们的服务项目问卷吗？","Would you like to join us in raising money for the disaster area?\t\t你愿意和我们一起为灾区募捐吗？","After you finish arranging these materials, can you help me check the order?\t\t你摆完这些资料后，可以帮我检查一下顺序吗？","Have you ever sought help from a social worker?\t\t你曾经向社工寻求过帮助吗？","Are you interested in taking part in this housekeeping service event?\t\t你有没有兴趣参加这次家政服务活动？","Have you considered joining the foundation as a volunteer?\t\t你有没有考虑加入基金会做志愿者？","Do you know which organizations subsidize children's tuition?\t\t你知道哪些机构会补贴孩子学费吗？","What do you think are the benefits of helping out locally in the community?\t\t你觉得在社区里就近帮忙有什么好处？","How do you think we should distribute these materials?\t\t你觉得我们应该怎么发放这些资料？","Which equipment do you think we need to repair?\t\t你觉得我们需要维修哪些设备？","Which appliances do you think we should repair first?\t\t你认为我们该先维修哪些电器？","children's foundation\t\t儿童基金会","fill out the questionnaire\t\t填写问卷","If you have an idea, you can start an event yourself.\t\t如果你有想法，可以自己发起一个活动。","If you need to go out of town, we can take care of your pets.\t\t如果你需要去外地，我们可以帮你照看宠物。","If we had more funding, we could help more residents.\t\t如果我们有更多的资金，就能帮助更多居民。","If we do not have enough funds, the project cannot proceed smoothly.\t\t如果我们没有足够的资金，项目就无法顺利进行。","promotional banner\t\t宣传横幅","promotional banner design\t\t宣传横幅设计","scope of housekeeping services\t\t家政服务内容","domestic service experience\t\t家政服务经验","demand for housekeeping services\t\t家政服务需求","Because they are busy with work, many parents choose to hire a nanny to take care of their children.\t\t很多家长因为工作忙，选择请保姆来照顾孩子。","The volunteers arranged different types of materials separately.\t\t志愿者们分别摆放了不同类型的资料。","I organized a concert to make the elderly happy.\t\t我为了让老人们开心而组织了一场音乐会。","Our school often collects donations for children living in poverty.\t\t我们学校经常为贫困儿童募捐。","Our group is responsible for distributing health handbooks to residents.\t\t我们小组负责向居民发放健康手册。","We ought to care more for older people so they feel warm.\t\t我们应该多关怀老人，让他们感到温暖。","We placed the manuals separately on different service desks.\t\t我们把手册分别摆在不同服务台上。","Our volunteers take care of the children in the community every day.\t\t我们的志愿者每天照看社区里的孩子们。","Our community has decided to build a new library.\t\t我们社区决定建设一个新的图书馆。","We need to show more care for older adults and let them feel warmth.\t\t我们需要多关怀老人，让他们感到温暖。","My family and I decided to raise funds for the hospital once each year.\t\t我和家人决定每年为医院募捐一次。","The nanny I know is very caring and also very patient.\t\t我认识的保姆非常有爱心，也很有耐心。","manual instructions\t\t手册说明","provide housekeeping services\t\t提供家政服务","education foundation\t\t教育基金会","new banner\t\t新的横幅","latest manual\t\t最新手册","local foundation\t\t本地基金会","cleaning crew\t\t清洁工团队","a cleaner's work\t\t清洁工的工作","the cleaner's tools\t\t清洁工的工具","warmhearted cleaner\t\t热心清洁工","Why does Wang Ming want to launch a new community project?\t\t王明为什么想发起新的社区项目？","electronic questionnaire\t\t电子问卷","The community decided to build a new library.\t\t社区决定建设一个新的图书馆。","social workers participate in activities\t\t社工参与活动","Social workers often organize activities that help community residents care about one another.\t\t社工经常组织活动，让社区居民互相关心。","eye-catching red banner\t\t红色醒目横幅","The organization helped many students by subsidizing lunches.\t\t组织通过补贴午餐，帮助了很多学生。","Which parts of the questionnaire do you think need revision?\t\t请问你觉得问卷有哪些地方需要修改？","source of funds\t\t资金来源","questionnaire collection\t\t问卷收集","questions in the questionnaire\t\t问卷问题","book housekeeping services\t\t预约家政服务","pick up the handbook\t\t领取手册"]],
  ["Hospital: Ask about patient symptoms",["x-ray diagnostic tool\t\tx光诊断工具","He is injured all over, he needs immediate surgery.\t\t他全身都是伤，需要马上做手术。","He is injured, his whole body is covered in blood.\t\t他受伤了，全身是血。","After waking up, he found himself still in the operating room.\t\t他醒来后，发现自己仍然在手术室里。","After a short rest, I finally felt better.\t\t休息了一会，我终于缓过来了。","How long did you wait outside the operating room?\t\t你在手术室外等了多长时间？","Are you afraid of being anesthetized?\t\t你害怕被麻醉吗？","Are you feeling better yet?\t\t你是不是感觉自己已经缓过来了？","Have you ever had anesthesia?\t\t你曾经被麻醉过吗？","Have you ever visited the hospital's surgical ward?\t\t你有没有参观过医院的外科病房？","Have you ever toured the hospital's operating room?\t\t你有没有参观过医院的手术室？","Do you know why doctors have to prioritize stopping bleeding?\t\t你知道医生为什么要优先止血吗？","Do you know who will be on duty next Wednesday night?\t\t你知道是谁下周三晚上要值班吗？","Do you think his condition has stabilized?\t\t你觉得他的病情稳定了吗？","Do you think the new doctor reacts quickly enough?\t\t你觉得新医生反应得够快吗？","Do you think the patient's cough has worsened?\t\t你觉得病人的咳嗽有没有恶化？","Do you feel there are changes in your heartbeat?\t\t你觉得自己的心跳有变化吗？","team of pediatricians\t\t儿科医生团队","pediatric emergency management\t\t儿科急诊处理","pediatric examination\t\t儿科检查","pediatric pneumonia diagnosis\t\t儿童肺炎诊断","prepare the operating room\t\t准备手术室","He was having trouble breathing just now, but now he is better.\t\t刚才他呼吸很困难，现在缓过来了。","Why does the doctor need to give you anesthesia?\t\t医生为什么要给你麻醉呢？","The doctor is administering emergency care to a patient.\t\t医生正在紧急抢救一位病人。","team of surgeons\t\t外科医生团队","During her internship, she learned how to stop bleeding using various methods.\t\t她在实习期间学会了用多种方法止血。","If you are not feeling well, the nurse will take you to the ward.\t\t如果你不舒服，护士会带你去病房。","If the heartbeat is too fast, the nurse will immediately notify the doctor.\t\t如果心跳过快，护士会立刻通知医生。","If the patient's condition worsens, the doctor will adjust the medication regimen.\t\t如果病人的情况恶化，医生会调整用药方案。","If the condition worsens, please notify me immediately.\t\t如果病情加重，请立即通知我。","schedule an x-ray\t\txclass=\"__word playback\">安排","preparation for heart surgery\t\t心脏病手术准备","analysis of heart disease medical records\t\t心脏病病历分析","heartbeat detection\t\t心跳检测","emergency x-ray\t\txclass=\"__word playback\">急诊","We will wait until the patient wakes up, then notify the family.\t\t我们等病人醒后再通知家人。","When I am on duty, I must record all patients' conditions.\t\t我值班的时候必须记录所有病人的情况。","I don't react fast enough.\t\t我反应得不够快。","When I had a fever, the nurse suggested that I drink more water and rest.\t\t我发热的时候，护士建议我多喝水并休息。","I couldn't have dinner with my family because I was on duty.\t\t我因为值班，没能和家人一起吃晚饭。","After the surgery, he woke up very quickly.\t\t手术后，他很快就醒过来了。","After the surgery, he gradually recovered.\t\t手术后，他慢慢缓过来了。","After the surgery, the patient slowly woke up.\t\t手术后，病人慢慢醒过来了。","operating room schedule\t\t手术室安排","operating room lighting\t\t手术室灯光","operating room entrance\t\t手术室门口","After the surgery ended, she woke up.\t\t手术结束后，她醒过来了。","Once the nurse realized the patient was short of breath, she promptly called the doctor for emergency treatment.\t\t护士发现病人呼吸困难后，立即通知医生来抢救。","The nurse recommended that the patient rest more, allowing their body to recover gradually.\t\t护士建议病人多休息，让身体慢慢缓过来。","The nurse carefully observes the patient's condition every day.\t\t护士每天仔细观察病人的病情。","Nurses administer intravenous infusions to patients every day.\t\t护士每天都会为病人输液。","The nurse checks the patient's heartbeat every day.\t\t护士每天都会检查病人的心跳。","Nurses are responsible for giving intravenous infusions to different patients every day.\t\t护士每天都负责给不同的患者输液。","take an x-ray\t\txclass=\"__word playback\">拍摄","control disease progression\t\t控制病情发展","measure heartbeat\t\t测量心跳","The patient feels weak all over.\t\t病人觉得全身没力气。","condition improving\t\t病情好转","condition stable\t\t病情稳定","after the condition has stabilized\t\t病情稳定后","ward assignment\t\t病房分配","the doctor in the ward\t\t病房里的医生","waiting for the X-ray report\t\txclass=\"__word playback\">等待","pneumonia recovery guidance\t\t肺炎康复指导","pneumonia recovery process\t\t肺炎恢复过程","observe the heartbeat\t\t观察心跳","assess the condition\t\t评估病情","After the car accident, he said he hurt all over.\t\t车祸后，他说全身都疼。","enter the operating room\t\t进入手术室","enter the ward\t\t进入病房","heart disease prevention measures\t\t预防心脏病措施"]],
  ["Campus Life: Discuss campus safety",["one on one guidance from a mentor\t\t一对一导师辅导","upload format requirements\t\t上传格式要求","primary contact\t\t主要联系人","main contact person's number\t\t主要联系人号码","They are designing a course for future engineers.\t\t他们正在设计一项面向未来工程师的课程。","The reason they transferred schools was that they wanted to take more specialized courses.\t\t他们转学的原因是想学习更多专业课程。","Are you ready to adjust the file format as required?\t\t你准备好按照要求调整文件格式了吗？","Do you want to know where I'm interning?\t\t你想知道我在哪儿实习吗？","Would you like to try it yourself, or should I give you a hint?\t\t你想自己试试，还是让我提示你一下？","Where are you planning to intern?\t\t你打算在哪里实习？","Do you know which cultural courses will be offered next semester?\t\t你知道下个学期会开设哪些文化课程吗？","Do you know which new courses will be offered next semester?\t\t你知道下学期会开设哪些新课程吗？","Which elective course do you think is the most interesting?\t\t你觉得哪一门选修课最有意思？","save in a new format\t\t保存为新格式","save the electronic version\t\t保存电子版","promptly handle problems\t\t及时处理问题","promptly obtain resources\t\t及时获得资源","friendly interviewer\t\t友好的面试官","reliable contact\t\t可靠的联系人","Learning another language is good too.\t\t多学一种语言也好。","large job fair\t\t大型招聘会","If you don't know the answer, I can give you a hint.\t\t如果你不知道答案，我可以提示你一下。","If you encounter problems while abroad, you can proactively seek help from your advisor.\t\t如果你在国外遇到问题，可以主动向导师寻求帮助。","If you forget to activate the software, will it affect your assignment submission?\t\t如果你忘记激活软件，会影响你的作业提交吗？","If you encounter difficulties in your studies, you can actively seek advice from your advisor.\t\t如果你遇到学习困难，可以主动向导师寻求建议。","If the university offers a Spanish course, I will definitely take it as an elective!\t\t如果大学开设西班牙语课，我一定要选修！","If I study abroad in the future, I will also consider sharing an apartment.\t\t如果我将来去国外学习，我也会考虑合租。","If I transfer, will this year's credits still count?\t\t如果我转学，今年的学分还会被认可吗？","If you have not activated your account, you will not be able to download course materials.\t\t如果没有激活账户，你将无法下载课程资料。","If this program is for international students, will the application process be different?\t\t如果这个项目面向国际学生，申请流程会不会不同？","I plan to look for a job on my own this year, without using an agency.\t\t我今年打算自己求职，不请中介帮忙。","The tablet I just bought needs to have its system activated before it can be used.\t\t我刚买的平板电脑需要激活系统才能使用。","My two classmates and I decided to rent an apartment together.\t\t我和两个同学决定一起合租一套公寓。","I chose two electives while I was studying abroad.\t\t我在留学期间选择了两门选修课。","I plan to look for a job on my own, because I want to gain interview experience.\t\t我打算自己求职，因为我想增加面试经验。","My elective meets every Wednesday afternoon.\t\t我的选修课安排在每周三下午。","register for elective courses\t\t报名选修课","job fair process\t\t招聘会流程","supported formats\t\t支持的格式","file format settings\t\t文件格式设置","electronic version of the document\t\t文件电子版","local contacts\t\t本地联系人","electronic version of the materials\t\t材料电子版","Whether you try it on your own or with a partner, the key is to take action.\t\t独自一人试试看也好，找个伙伴一起做也好，关键是行动起来。","study abroad advisor recommendation\t\t留学导师推荐","Renting a small apartment is good too, it saves money.\t\t租个小公寓也好，比较省钱。","a tight routine\t\t紧凑的作息","tight schedule\t\t紧凑的日程","experienced interviewer\t\t经验丰富的面试官","uniform processing\t\t统一处理","unified update\t\t统一更新","unified management\t\t统一管理","contact person information\t\t联系人信息","contact list\t\t联系人名单","Whether you apply on your own or ask someone for help, you need to prepare ahead of time.\t\t自己申请也好，找人帮忙也好，你都要提前准备。","comparison between Chinese and English\t\t语文与英语对比","Chinese language learning environment\t\t语文学习环境","content of the Chinese language textbook\t\t语文教材内容","Chinese exam scores\t\t语文考试成绩","Chinese reading comprehension\t\t语文阅读理解","This software supports various formats, you can choose freely.\t\t这个软件支持多种格式，你可以自由选择。","elective course homework\t\t选修课作业","elective course time\t\t选修课时间","interviewer's evaluation\t\t面试官的评价"]],
  ["Apologies: Admit your mistakes",["Although they blame me, I have already done my best to remedy it.\t\t他们虽然埋怨我，但我已经尽力补救了。","He admitted he made a hasty decision and did not consider the consequences.\t\t他承认草率地做了决定，没有考虑后果。","His reply yesterday was indeed somewhat hasty.\t\t他昨天的回复确实有些草率。","He misunderstood, it is no big deal.\t\t他误会了就误会了，没关系。","The meeting was canceled, so be it, no problem.\t\t会议取消了就取消了，没关系。","The meeting got postponed, no big deal.\t\t会议推迟了就推迟了，没关系。","The meeting started late, no problem.\t\t会议晚开了就晚开了，没关系。","You took a break, it is okay.\t\t你休息了就休息了，没关系。","Will you be angry because of my rude attitude yesterday?\t\t你会因为我昨天粗鲁的态度而生气吗？","If you feel that what I say lacks tact, please tell me.\t\t你如果觉得我说话没有分寸，请告诉我。","You forgot, no problem.\t\t你忘记了就忘记了，没关系。","Have you thought about how to fix yesterday's mistake?\t\t你有没有想过怎么补救昨天的失误？","Are you satisfied with the compensation we provided?\t\t你满意我们提供的补偿吗？","Could you pass along my apology?\t\t你能不能帮我转达一下我的道歉？","Can you forgive my oversight?\t\t你能原谅我的疏忽吗？","Do you think there is still time to apply to change my ticket now?\t\t你觉得如果我现在申请改签，还来得及吗？","Do you think I offended you today?\t\t你觉得我今天得罪你了吗？","Do you think I was overly petty yesterday?\t\t你觉得我昨天是不是过于计较了？","Do you think I agreed too hastily?\t\t你觉得我是不是太草率地答应了？","Do you think my compensation is enough?\t\t你觉得我的补偿足够了吗？","Do you think this kind of compensation is acceptable?\t\t你觉得这样的补偿能接受吗？","What reason do you need to forgive me?\t\t你需要什么理由才能原谅我？","Let's do it then, I will be careful.\t\t做就做吧，我会小心的。","measured and appropriate\t\t分寸得当","Even if colleagues complain about me, I will still take responsibility.\t\t即使同事埋怨我，我也会承担责任。","Because I was late, I have to go get my train ticket changed.\t\t因为我迟到了，我必须去改签我的火车票。","Because I was late, we delayed our departure.\t\t因为我迟到，我们耽误了出发的时间。","Do you think it is appropriate to apologize in public?\t\t在公开场合道歉是否适当，你觉得呢？","She has been reminding me to pay attention to propriety, not to hurt others.\t\t她一直提醒我要注意分寸，不要伤害别人。","If I had not gotten stuck in traffic, we would not have had to change our tickets at all.\t\t如果不是因为我堵车，我们根本不需要改签。","If the product is defective, we will replace it for free.\t\t如果产品有缺陷，我们会免费更换。","If you have any compensation requests, please tell me directly.\t\t如果你有任何补偿要求，请直接告诉我。","If you apologize sincerely, many things can be remedied.\t\t如果你认真道歉，很多事情都可以补救。","If you see him, please tell him I am sorry.\t\t如果你遇见他，请帮我转达一声对不起。","If I have offended you, please forgive me.\t\t如果我得罪了你，请你原谅我。","If I have delayed your work, please forgive me.\t\t如果我耽误了你的工作，请你原谅。","If I made you feel that I was too petty, please forgive me.\t\t如果我让你觉得我太计较，请原谅我。","My mom scolded me because I was very rude to the guest.\t\t妈妈批评了我，因为我对客人很粗鲁。","Mom scolded me for crossing the line, I really regret it.\t\t妈妈批评我没有分寸，我真的很后悔。","Mom says I should speak with restraint and not hurt others.\t\t妈妈说我说话要有分寸，不要伤害别人。","Forget it, let's start over.\t\t忘就忘吧，我们重新开始。","I bought it, no point hesitating.\t\t我买了就买了，没有什么可犹豫的。","We were late, it's okay.\t\t我们晚到了就晚到了，没关系。","We all have embarrassing moments, do not be too hard on yourself.\t\t我们每个人都会有丢人的时候，不要太自责。","I promise I won't be so rude again.\t\t我保证以后不会再这么粗鲁了。","I sent the wrong file due to an oversight, I am very sorry.\t\t我因为疏忽把文件发错了，非常抱歉。","I mailed the document to the wrong address by mistake.\t\t我因为疏忽把文件寄错地址了。","I am very sorry for yesterday's mistake.\t\t我对昨天的失误感到非常抱歉。","I am very sorry about yesterday's mistake.\t\t我对昨天的错误感到非常抱歉。","I have already realized my mistake, and I am very sorry.\t\t我已经意识到自己的错误，并且非常抱歉。","I am very sorry I did not finish the task on time yesterday.\t\t我很抱歉昨天没有按时完成任务。","I admit my choice was too hasty, I did not fully consider the consequences.\t\t我承认我的选择太草率，没有充分考虑后果。","I said the wrong thing at the meeting yesterday, it was really embarrassing.\t\t我昨天在会上说错话，真的很丢人。","I was too direct yesterday, will you dislike me?\t\t我昨天说话太直接，你会不会嫌弃我？","I know my previous attitude made you think I looked down on you.\t\t我知道我之前的态度让你以为我在嫌弃你。","I laughed, what's the problem?\t\t我笑了就笑了，有什么问题吗？","I promise you I won't delay your work next time.\t\t我答应你下次不会再耽误你的工作了。","Fine, I'll admit it, I know I was too impulsive.\t\t承认就承认吧，我知道自己太冲动了。","new defect\t\t新的缺陷","What I did yesterday may have offended the manager.\t\t昨天我做的事可能得罪了经理。","Yesterday I left the documents at home, how embarrassing!\t\t昨天我把文件忘在家里，真是太丢人了！","Among friends, there should be mutual tolerance, do not be quick to look down on each other.\t\t朋友之间应该互相包容，不要轻易嫌弃对方。","formal opening remarks\t\t正式开场白","formal opening remarks\t\t正式的开场白","no good reason\t\t没有好理由","no reason\t\t没有理由","Is there still time now to fix it?\t\t现在补救还来得及吗？","line up at the boarding gate\t\t登机口排队","boarding gate announcement\t\t登机口通知","polite opening remarks\t\t礼貌开场白","system defect\t\t系统缺陷","correct defects\t\t纠正缺陷","give reasons\t\t给出理由","The teacher complained that I did not finish the homework on time, I feel very guilty.\t\t老师埋怨我没有按时完成作业，我很内疚。","compensation method\t\t补偿方式","fix defects\t\t解决缺陷","The plan got postponed, it's fine.\t\t计划推迟了就推迟了，没关系。","appropriately comfort the other person\t\t适当安慰对方","the right attitude\t\t适当的态度","the right time\t\t适当的时机","appropriately express regret\t\t适当表达遗憾","opening line of an apology\t\t道歉的开场白","avoid defects\t\t避免缺陷","need a reason\t\t需要理由","The flight's delayed, it's fine.\t\t飞机延误了就延误了，没关系。"]],
  ["Inclusion: Talk about asking for help",["Since starting college, I have become more self-reliant than before.\t\t上大学以后，我变得比以前更自主了。","People do not discuss price issues much.\t\t人们不怎么讨论价格问题。","He does not use these services much.\t\t他不怎么使用这些服务。","He doesn't really like cleaning.\t\t他不怎么喜欢打扫卫生。","He is not very busy.\t\t他不怎么忙。","He does not consider the price much.\t\t他不怎么考虑价格。","They don't use these services much.\t\t他们不怎么使用这些服务。","They are not very willing to offer a discount.\t\t他们不怎么愿意提供折扣。","When they are dancing, they look especially coordinated.\t\t他们跳舞的时候，看起来特别协调。","They do not play soccer very well.\t\t他们踢足球踢得不怎么好。","He usually is not very confused.\t\t他平时不怎么困惑。","Where do you usually get information?\t\t你一般会在哪里获取信息？","Do you find the light switch in this bathroom easy to use?\t\t你会不会觉得这个浴室的灯开关很顺手？","You don't practice yoga very seriously.\t\t你做瑜伽做得不怎么认真。","Do you know where the handrail should be placed?\t\t你知道扶手应该放在哪个位置吗？","Can you help me translate the event schedule into Braille?\t\t你能帮我把活动流程翻译成盲文吗？","Do you think the height of the handrail is appropriate?\t\t你觉得扶手的高度合适吗？","Do you think ordinary people can afford the cost of these services?\t\t你觉得普通人能负担这些服务的开销吗？","Do you think it is necessary to install grab bars in the bathroom?\t\t你觉得浴室里需要安装扶手吗？","Do you think hiking is strenuous, or very easy?\t\t你觉得爬山费劲吗，还是很轻松？","Do you find it hard to walk with a cane?\t\t你觉得用拐杖走路很难吗？","Do you think your movements are coordinated?\t\t你觉得自己的动作协调吗？","Do you think this button's height is appropriate?\t\t你觉得这个按钮的高度合适吗？","Do you find these large buttons easy to use?\t\t你觉得这些大号按钮方便使用吗？","Do you find running ten kilometers hard?\t\t你跑十公里会觉得费劲吗？","follow the Paralympic Games\t\t关注残奥会","produce animated works\t\t制作动画作品","animation creation activities\t\t动画创作活动","medical insurance application\t\t医疗保险申请","health insurance costs\t\t医疗保险费用","harmonious cooperation\t\t协调的配合","participate in the Paralympic Games\t\t参加残奥会","both hands grasp the cane\t\t双手握拐杖","The team leader must make sure all equipment works properly.\t\t团队负责人必须确保设备都能正常使用。","You can find a lot of useful information online.\t\t在网上可以获取很多有用的信息。","basic medical insurance\t\t基本医疗保险","My grandma told me she thinks the button next to the toilet is very handy.\t\t奶奶告诉我，她觉得马桶旁边的按钮很顺手。","She does not think much about the cost.\t\t她不怎么考虑费用问题。","She has been healthy lately, so she does not need much care.\t\t她最近身体好，所以不怎么需要照顾。","Every time she does push-ups, she finds them really hard.\t\t她每次做俯卧撑都觉得特别费劲。","Her skiing did not go very smoothly.\t\t她滑雪滑得不怎么顺利。","She covers all the expenses herself, and she is under tremendous pressure.\t\t她独自负担全部费用，压力非常大。","If the price is too high, many people cannot afford it.\t\t如果价格太高，很多人就无法负担。","If you can manage your own time, you will be more efficient.\t\t如果你能自主安排时间，就会变得更有效率。","Mom always likes economical and practical choices.\t\t妈妈总是喜欢经济又实用的选择。","learn sign language\t\t学习手语","safety handrail\t\t安全扶手","volunteers who help blind people\t\t帮助盲人的志愿者","I have always closely followed the Paralympic events.\t\t我一直很关注残奥会的比赛项目。","I am not very tired.\t\t我不怎么累。","We do not really participate in community activities.\t\t我们不怎么参与社区活动。","Our plan is not particularly complicated.\t\t我们的计划不怎么复杂。","We need to ensure everyone can receive the event notice.\t\t我们需要确保每个人都能收到活动通知。","We need to evaluate which plan is most economical.\t\t我们需要评估哪种方案最经济。","I will get a lot of support from my friends.\t\t我会从朋友那里获取很多支持。","When I was a child, I once dreamed of participating in the Paralympic Games.\t\t我小时候曾梦想参加残奥会。","I don't swim very fast.\t\t我游泳得不怎么快。","I don't swim very fast.\t\t我游泳游得不怎么快。","My life is not very complicated.\t\t我的生活不怎么复杂。","I think actively facing problems can make me more independent.\t\t我觉得主动面对问题能让我变得更加自主。","I find running a marathon especially tough.\t\t我觉得跑马拉松特别费劲。","I do not dance very well.\t\t我跳舞跳得不怎么好看。","sign language speaker\t\t手语演讲者","get the cane back\t\t找回拐杖","look for a crosswalk\t\t找斑马线","provide sign language support\t\t提供手语支持","a cane that supports the body\t\t支撑身体的拐杖","wooden cane\t\t木头拐杖","Paralympic gold medal\t\t残奥会金牌","light button\t\t灯光按钮","apply for health insurance\t\t申请医疗保险","educational resources for blind people\t\t盲人教育资源","welfare for blind people\t\t盲人福利","Braille information\t\t盲文信息","budget price range\t\t经济价位","affordable price range\t\t经济合理的价位","The teacher should make sure each student has understood the rules.\t\t老师应该确保每位学生都理解了规则。","The teacher suggested we print out the important information in Braille.\t\t老师建议我们把重要信息用盲文打印出来。","Although swimming was very strenuous, I still kept at it.\t\t虽然游泳很费劲，但我还是坚持下来了。","watch the Paralympic Games\t\t观看残奥会","walk toward the crosswalk\t\t走向斑马线","cross at the crosswalk\t\t过斑马线","relying on a cane for support\t\t靠拐杖支撑","grab bar near the toilet\t\t靠近马桶的扶手","the button near the toilet\t\t靠近马桶的按钮"]],
  ["Perspectives: Share your views",["People from different cultural backgrounds tend to have different opinions.\t\t不同文化背景的人往往有不同的看法。","biological son\t\t亲生儿子","biological brothers\t\t亲生兄弟","biological mother\t\t亲生母亲","He did not want to discuss this issue, so he chose to avoid it.\t\t他不想谈这个问题，就选择回避。","They argue back and forth, they just want to express their own views.\t\t他们争来争去，都是想表达自己的观点。","As they kept listening, they ended up accepting the new ideas.\t\t他们听着听着就接受了新观念。","They often argue back and forth over some topics.\t\t他们经常为一些话题争来争去。","They often argue online, because everyone has different opinions.\t\t他们经常在网上吵，因为每个人的看法不同。","They talked back and forth, they just wanted to make things clear.\t\t他们聊来聊去，就是想把话说清楚。","He thinks everyone should understand the meaning of equal rights.\t\t他认为每个人都应该了解平等权益的意义。","Have you ever considered the female perspective?\t\t你有没有考虑过女性的视角？","Your words directly reflect your values.\t\t你的话直接体现了你的价值观。","Which perspective do you think is more persuasive?\t\t你觉得哪种视角更有说服力？","Do you think finding the right partner is important?\t\t你觉得找到合适的伴侣重要吗？","You talk and talk, you just want to prove you are right.\t\t你说来说去，就是想证明自己对。","advanced culture\t\t先进文化","advanced technology\t\t先进的技术","advanced lifestyle\t\t先进的生活方式","advanced ideas\t\t先进的观念","advanced society\t\t先进社会","focus of public attention\t\t公众焦点","Stop arguing, you all have a point.\t\t别争了，你们的看法都有道理。","the problem of stereotypes\t\t刻板印象问题","oppose discriminatory behavior\t\t反对歧视行为","In our community, there are some families who have adopted orphans.\t\t在我们社区，有一些家庭收养了孤儿。","Everyone keeps arguing back and forth, they just do not agree with each other's views.\t\t大家吵来吵去，就是不同意彼此的看法。","She bravely shared her own experience of being discriminated against.\t\t她勇敢地分享了自己被歧视的经历。","If you want to adopt a child, what documents do you need to prepare?\t\t如果你想收养孩子，需要准备哪些文件？","If we ignore gender issues, society may become unfair.\t\t如果我们忽视性别问题，社会可能会不公平。","Mom told me that avoiding problems cannot solve problems.\t\t妈妈告诉我，回避问题并不能解决问题。","media focus\t\t媒体焦点","Schools should educate students not to discriminate against any group.\t\t学校应该教育学生不要歧视任何群体。","dignity and rights\t\t尊严与权利","dignity and rights\t\t尊严和权利","discussion among young people\t\t年轻群体讨论","Let's not avoid different ideas.\t\t我们不要回避不同的想法。","We went back and forth in the group chat, but we just couldn't find a solution.\t\t我们在群里讨论来讨论去，就是找不到解决办法。","Our group often discusses the issue of gender equality.\t\t我们小组常常讨论性别平等的问题。","Our group often discusses the issue of gender equality.\t\t我们小组经常讨论性别平等的问题。","We keep talking, all for you.\t\t我们聊来聊去，都是为了你。","As we kept chatting, we came to understand each other better.\t\t我们聊着聊着就更理解彼此了。","My mom grew up in a single-parent family, she is very strong-willed.\t\t我妈妈在单亲家庭里长大，她非常要强。","I have already formed a habit.\t\t我已经形成习惯了。","I hope that going forward we can argue less and better understand each other's position.\t\t我希望以后我们能少吵多理解对方的立场。","I hope that every person in the group can freely express their own thoughts.\t\t我希望群体里的每个人都能自由表达自己的想法。","I have a friend who comes from a single-parent family.\t\t我有一个朋友，他来自一个单亲家庭。","I think gender should not limit everyone's development.\t\t我觉得性别不应该限制每个人的发展。","I think everyone should have their own dignity.\t\t我认为每个人都应该拥有自己的尊严。","As I kept reading, I fell in love with these stories.\t\t我读着读着，就爱上了这些故事。","change perspective\t\t换个视角","educational focus\t\t教育焦点","Yesterday, the teacher told us not to discriminate against anyone.\t\t昨天，老师告诉我们不要歧视任何人。","Some people will avoid this topic.\t\t有些人会回避这个话题。","Some people believe that gender discrimination still exists in society.\t\t有人认为社会上还存在性别歧视。","Some people think certain practices may lead to discrimination.\t\t有的人觉得某些做法可能带来歧视。","Everyone should have the right to choose their own partner.\t\t每个人都应该有权利选择自己的伴侣。","the main provisions of the bill\t\t法案的主要内容","the person at the center of attention\t\t焦点人物","focus shift\t\t焦点转移","the focus of public attention\t\t社会关注的焦点","social group rights and interests\t\t社会群体权益","uphold dignity\t\t维护尊严","The teacher told students to question the stereotypes in society.\t\t老师告诉学生要质疑社会上的刻板印象。","gain dignity\t\t获得尊严","driven and independent\t\t要强又独立","a strong-willed personality\t\t要强的性格","a competitive father\t\t要强的父亲","differences in perspective\t\t视角差异","Who can strive to secure our rights and interests?\t\t谁能为我们争取权益？","This conflict reflects everyone's different ideas.\t\t这个矛盾能体现了大家不同的想法。","This topic tends to spark discussion.\t\t这个话题往往容易引起讨论。","This view was gradually formed.\t\t这种看法是慢慢形成的。","These kinds of issues are often quite sensitive.\t\t这类问题往往比较敏感。","This bill mainly concerns community safety.\t\t这项法案主要和社区安全有关。","This bill is still under discussion.\t\t这项法案还在讨论中。","That kind of attitude does not develop overnight.\t\t那种态度不是一天形成的。"]],
  ["The Cosmos: Ask about space facts",["a distance of one light-year\t\t一光年距离","Experts are researching more efficient ways to communicate with Mars.\t\t专家们正在研究更高效的火星通讯方法。","Experts believe the Sun has about another five billion years left.\t\t专家认为，太阳的寿命大致还有五十亿年。","beyond two light-years\t\t两光年之外","Why does the Sun look larger than other stars?\t\t为什么太阳看起来比其他星星大？","the shooting star in the book\t\t书里的流星","When was the last time you saw a shooting star?\t\t你上次看到流星是什么时候？","Do you know how hard it is to communicate with Mars?\t\t你知道火星通讯有多困难吗？","use a telescope\t\t使用望远镜","light-year calculation\t\t光年计算","theories about the moon\t\t关于月球的理论","Arctic Circle aurora\t\t北极圈极光","A satellite is a satellite, a planet is a planet, completely different.\t\t卫星是卫星，行星是行星，完全不一样。","Earth is Earth, outer space is outer space, the situation is completely different.\t\t地球是地球，太空是太空，情况完全不同。","base amenities\t\t基地生活设施","the sun's temperature\t\t太阳的温度","the sun's energy\t\t太阳的能量","the sun's orbit\t\t太阳的轨道","If the frequency of meteor impacts increases, we should make preparations in advance.\t\t如果流星撞击频率增加，我们应该提前做好准备。","If a planet deviates from its orbit, what will happen?\t\t如果行星偏离轨道，会发生什么事？","huge sun\t\t巨大的太阳","video footage\t\t录像画面","Ideas are ideas, results are results.\t\t想法归想法，结果归结果。","Ideas are ideas, actions are actions.\t\t想法归想法，行动归行动。","I have always dreamed of seeing the Northern Lights with my own eyes.\t\t我一直梦想能亲眼看到一次极光。","We were all very excited when we saw a video on TV of a meteor hitting a planet.\t\t我们在电视上看到流星撞击行星的视频时都很兴奋。","I read in a book that some stars are several hundred light-years away from us.\t\t我在书上看到，有的星星离我们几百光年远。","I think that in the future humanity will be able to communicate directly with a Mars base.\t\t我认为未来人类可以直接与火星基地通讯。","Promises are one thing, actions are another.\t\t承诺归承诺，实践归实践。","Promises are one thing, performance is another.\t\t承诺归承诺，表现归表现。","recorded video\t\t拍摄的录像","explore the surface\t\t探索表面","provide video footage\t\t提供录像","Last night I saw the beautiful Milky Way.\t\t昨天晚上我看见了美丽的银河。","The moon is the moon, the sun is the sun, their energy sources are different.\t\t月亮是月亮，太阳是太阳，它们的能量来源不同。","the moon's composition\t\t月球的成分","lunar surface temperature\t\t月球表面温度","lunar resources\t\t月球资源","Some stars explode.\t\t有些星星会发生爆炸。","the telescope's lens\t\t望远镜的镜头","future Mars base\t\t未来火星基地","the colors of the aurora\t\t极光的色彩","soft light\t\t柔和的光线","soft colors\t\t柔和的色彩","soft blue\t\t柔和的蓝色","search for constellations\t\t查找星座","look up zodiac information\t\t查找星座资料","Appreciation is appreciation, understanding is understanding, both are benefits.\t\t欣赏归欣赏，理解归理解，都是收获。","Mars mission plan\t\t火星任务计划","Martian topography\t\t火星地形","scientific research on Mars\t\t火星科学研究","soft lighting\t\t灯光柔和","familiar constellations\t\t熟悉的星座","footage from the scene\t\t现场录像","Ideals are ideals, life is life.\t\t理想归理想，生活归生活。","the origin of life\t\t生命的起源","the real Moon\t\t真实的月球","a real meteor\t\t真实的流星","Scientists have been exploring whether there is life on Mars.\t\t科学家一直在探索火星上是否存在生命。","Scientists believe the Sun is about four point six billion years old.\t\t科学家认为太阳的年龄大致为四十六亿年。","Scientists believe the universe began with the Big Bang.\t\t科学家认为，宇宙起源于一次大爆炸。","stable orbit\t\t稳定轨道","red sun\t\t红色的太阳","planetary surface\t\t行星表面","planetary orbit\t\t行星轨道","observe changes in the constellations\t\t观察星座变化","watch video\t\t观看录像","Planning is planning, execution is execution.\t\t计划归计划，执行归执行。","Ideas are ideas, results are results.\t\t设想归设想，结果归结果。","orbital period\t\t轨道周期","orbital speed\t\t轨道速度","enter orbit\t\t进入轨道","enchanting aurora\t\t迷人的极光","the Milky Way and the stars\t\t银河与星星","the center of the Milky Way\t\t银河中央","the shape of the Milky Way\t\t银河的形状","rare footage\t\t难得的录像","A prediction is a prediction, a result is a result.\t\t预测归预测，结果归结果。"]],
  ["Updates: Explain how to use AI tools",["an image\t\t一幅图像","contextual analysis\t\t上下文环境分析","upload portfolio\t\t上传作品集","different application scenarios\t\t不同应用场景","personal portfolio\t\t个人作品集","personal preference settings\t\t个人喜好设定","I added category tags to make management easier.\t\t为了方便管理，我添加了分类标签。","Artificial intelligence makes our work even more efficient.\t\t人工智能使我们的工作变得更加高效。","Artificial intelligence makes our work more efficient.\t\t人工智能使我们的工作变得更高效。","Artificial intelligence has greatly increased my work efficiency.\t\t人工智能使我的工作效率提高了很多。","Artificial intelligence can optimize production processes, making work more efficient.\t\t人工智能可以优化生产流程，让工作更高效。","Artificial intelligence can turn a sentence into an image.\t\t人工智能可以把一句话扩展成一张图片。","Artificial intelligence can expand the content to make it clearer.\t\t人工智能能把内容扩展得更清楚。","portfolio display\t\t作品集展示","portfolio organization\t\t作品集整理","portfolio editing\t\t作品集编辑","Will you remember to turn the TV off after you get home from work?\t\t你下班回家后会记得关掉电视吗？","Can you use the voice assistant to turn off the living room TV?\t\t你可以用语音助手来关掉客厅的电视吗？","Which interface do you like, the old version or the new version?\t\t你喜欢哪个界面，旧版还是新版？","Have you ever tried letting a robot help you proofread your paper?\t\t你有没有尝试过让机器人帮你校对论文？","Have you ever tried letting AI help you proofread letters?\t\t你有没有试过让人工智能帮你校对信件？","Which version do you think has more powerful functionality?\t\t你觉得哪个版本的功能更强大？","The company uses artificial intelligence to optimize customer service so customers are more satisfied.\t\t公司利用人工智能优化客户服务，让客户更满意。","create a portfolio\t\t制作作品集","image analysis results\t\t图像分析结果","image processing software\t\t图像处理软件","image library resources\t\t图像库资源","image training set\t\t图像训练库","image recognition technology\t\t图像识别技术","scene change\t\t场景变化","scene background information\t\t场景背景信息","scene setup method\t\t场景设置方法","complex scene management\t\t复杂场景管理","If you compare carefully, you will find the differences are quite obvious.\t\t如果你仔细对照，就会发现差异很明显。","If we enter more keywords, the system will automatically add the elements we want.\t\t如果我们输入更多关键词，系统会自动添加想要的元素。","My younger sister is worried that the new smart TV does not perform as well as the old one.\t\t妹妹担心新买的智能电视性能不如旧的。","It can enhance image detail.\t\t它可以扩展图片的细节。","a vivid example\t\t形象的例子","vivid metaphor\t\t形象的比喻","color image\t\t彩色图像","We can use artificial intelligence to optimize workflows.\t\t我们可以用人工智能来优化工作流程。","Our team spent six months developing the new version.\t\t我们团队花了六个月开发了新版本。","I just compared the running speeds of these two versions, and the difference is significant.\t\t我刚刚对照了这两个版本的运行速度，结果差别很大。","I’ve noticed the upgraded smart light bulb’s performance is more stable now.\t\t我发现升级后的智能灯泡性能更稳定了。","I noticed the new interface adds many useful features.\t\t我发现新版界面增加了很多实用功能。","After I get home, I'll use my phone to turn off the living room lights.\t\t我回家后会用手机关掉客厅的灯。","I used artificial intelligence to organize my portfolio.\t\t我用人工智能整理了我的作品集。","I used AI software to proofread my paper.\t\t我用人工智能软件校对了我的论文。","improve performance\t\t提高性能","Database management\t\t数据库管理","the new version's interface design\t\t新版界面设计","the new version of the page\t\t新版页面","clarify the contextual content\t\t明确上下文内容","Smart speakers will record family members' music preferences.\t\t智能音响会记录家人的音乐喜好。","update portfolio\t\t更新作品集","the machine's intent\t\t机器的意图","model training library\t\t模型训练库","version update notification\t\t版本更新通知","simulation of real-world scenarios\t\t现实场景模拟","user preference analysis\t\t用户喜好分析","user intent\t\t用户意图","relevant context\t\t相关的上下文","simulation of real world scenarios\t\t真实场景模拟","true intentions\t\t真实意图","simple, clear interface\t\t简单清晰的界面","clean interface\t\t简洁的界面","exquisite portfolio\t\t精美的作品集","system intent\t\t系统意图","lack of contextual cues\t\t缺乏上下文提示","The teacher suggests that everyone first try out the free version.\t\t老师建议大家先试用免费版本。","old version features\t\t老版本功能","virtual image\t\t虚拟图像","virtual scene applications\t\t虚拟场景应用","add necessary context\t\t补充必要上下文","express intention\t\t表达意图","trial version experience\t\t试用版本体验","speech input system\t\t语音输入系统","explain intent\t\t说明意图","adjust preference mode\t\t调整喜好模式","resource sharing repository\t\t资源共享库","This company has been developing artificial intelligence products for ten years.\t\t这个公司开发人工智能产品已经有十年了。","page content\t\t页面内容"]],
  ["Classroom: Describe your classmates",["a leave slip\t\t一份请假条","a piece of chalk\t\t一支粉笔","submit the leave slip\t\t交请假条","Have you already checked in online today?\t\t你今天已经在网上签到了吗？","Did you pay attention during the class meeting?\t\t你们在班会上有没有专心听讲？","Do you feel that the restroom often has an unusual odor?\t\t你们有没有觉得卫生间经常有异味？","Can you lend me the workbook?\t\t你可以把练习册借给我吗？","Did you bring the workbook to school?\t\t你带练习册来学校了吗？","Why didn't you check in on time yesterday?\t\t你昨天为什么没有及时签到？","How many homework assignments did you grade yesterday?\t\t你昨天批了多少份作业？","Have you used this new workbook?\t\t你用过这本新的练习册吗？","Do you know how to write a leave request?\t\t你知道请假条应该怎么写吗？","Which kind of eraser do you think erases most cleanly?\t\t你觉得哪种橡皮擦得最干净？","Do you think drinking coffee can prevent zoning out?\t\t你觉得喝咖啡能防止走神吗？","What do you think we should do if someone falls behind?\t\t你觉得如果有人跟不上进度，我们该怎么办？","Do you think the graded tests have helped you improve?\t\t你觉得批过的试卷有没有帮助你进步？","Who in the class do you think is the friendliest?\t\t你觉得班里的谁最友善？","Do you think the class monitor is especially friendly?\t\t你觉得班长是不是特别友善？","Do you think the teacher is strict when grading?\t\t你觉得老师打分的时候严格吗？","Do you think the teacher will be very strict when grading?\t\t你觉得老师打分的时候会很严格吗？","After grouping, each group needs to be responsible for one topic.\t\t分组以后，每组需要负责一个话题。","restroom facilities\t\t卫生间设施","restroom doorway\t\t卫生间门口","consult the stroke order dictionary\t\t参考笔顺字典","friendly atmosphere\t\t友善的气氛","national flag display\t\t国旗展示","If you forget to sign in, the teacher will remind you.\t\t如果你忘记签到，老师会提醒你。","If you always zone out, the teacher may notice.\t\t如果你总是走神，老师可能会注意到。","If you doze off, the teacher will call your name and have you answer a question.\t\t如果你打瞌睡，老师会点你的名字让你回答问题。","If you feel you are not keeping up, please tell the teacher as soon as possible.\t\t如果你觉得跟不上进度，请及时告诉老师。","If you feel you cannot keep up, please feel free to raise your hand and ask a question!\t\t如果你觉得跟不上，请大胆举手提问！","If you listen carefully, you will understand the content of the meeting.\t\t如果你认真听讲，就能理解会议的内容。","If none of us pays attention, the class meeting will be pointless.\t\t如果我们都不专心听讲，班会就没有意义了。","If I marked it wrong, please let me know right away.\t\t如果我批错了，请及时告诉我。","learn the stroke order rules\t\t学习笔顺规则","After being divided into groups, students can exchange ideas with each other.\t\t学生们分组后可以互相交流想法。","ignore punctuation details\t\t忽略标点细节","I used a red pen to correct my math homework today.\t\t我今天用红笔订正了数学作业。","Our class decided to take turns cleaning the bathroom once a week.\t\t我们班决定每周轮流打扫一次卫生间。","Our teacher asked me to introduce China's national flag.\t\t我们老师请我介绍中国的国旗。","I find mechanical pencils more convenient than traditional pencils.\t\t我发现自动铅笔比传统铅笔更方便。","In class, I introduced China's national flag.\t\t我在课堂上介绍了中国的国旗。","I bring my workbook to class every day.\t\t我每天上课都会带着我的练习册。","I bring an eraser to school every day.\t\t我每天都会带一块橡皮去学校。","I use a pencil to take notes in a notebook every day.\t\t我每天都用铅笔在笔记本上记笔记。","my eraser\t\t我的橡皮","I think Wang Ming was very friendly at the class meeting.\t\t我觉得王明在班会上表现得非常友善。","I cannot keep up with the group's pace, so I need more practice.\t\t我跟不上小组的速度，所以需要更多的练习。","newly built bathroom\t\t新建的卫生间","new eraser\t\t新橡皮","new workbook\t\t新练习册","Yesterday afternoon's class meeting was very boring, I saw Wang Ming dozing off.\t\t昨天下午的班会很无聊，我看到王明在打瞌睡。","view punctuation issues\t\t查看标点问题","view leave request\t\t查看请假条","check stroke order errors\t\t查笔顺错误","punctuation check\t\t标点符号检查","check for stroke order errors\t\t检查笔顺错误","After every test, we have to correct all the questions we got wrong.\t\t每次考试后，我们都必须订正所有做错的题目。","compare different national flags\t\t比较不同国旗","Wang Ming often marks his textbook with a pencil.\t\t王明常常用铅笔在课本上做标记。","stroke order practice\t\t笔顺练习","writing with chalk\t\t粉笔写字","chalk allocation plan\t\t粉笔分配方案","chalk and blackboard\t\t粉笔和黑板","The teacher not only assigns grades, but also writes down feedback comments.\t\t老师不仅打分，还会写下反馈意见。","The teacher has already graded all the students' homework.\t\t老师已经批了所有同学的作业。","The teacher suggested that we form groups based on interests.\t\t老师建议我们根据兴趣分组。","The teacher drew four big circles on the blackboard with chalk, representing four different small groups.\t\t老师用粉笔在黑板上画了四个大圈，表示四个不同的小组。","The teacher required the students to correct the exam questions after class.\t\t老师要求同学们下课后订正考试题。","The teacher told us to complete the homework in the workbook.\t\t老师让我们在练习册里完成作业。","English workbook\t\t英语练习册","Students who have received certificates of merit, please come to the front.\t\t获得奖状的同学们请到前面来。","Please line up to use the restroom, no crowding.\t\t请大家自觉排队使用卫生间，不要拥挤。","Not participating in this, not participating in that, the meeting cannot proceed.\t\t这也不参加，那也不参加，会议没法进行。","This is not responding, that is not responding, how can we solve the problem?\t\t这也不回应，那也不回应，怎么解决问题？","Neither this nor that is convenient, what should we do?\t\t这也不方便，那也不方便，我们该怎么办？","If you do not look at this or that, you cannot grasp the content.\t\t这也不看，那也不看，内容就无法掌握。","This will not do, that will not do, the discussion has made no progress.\t\t这也不行，那也不行，讨论没有进展。","submit a leave request\t\t递交请假条","write the stroke order again\t\t重新写笔顺","pick up the award certificate\t\t领取奖状"]],
  ["Roads: Give road safety advice",["one police car\t\t一辆警车","used car market\t\t二手汽车市场","Traffic rules must not be violated.\t\t交通规则违反不得。","You should slow down before turning to ensure safety.\t\t你在拐弯前应该先减速，确保安全。","Do you think green lights always help us?\t\t你是不是觉得绿灯总是在帮助我们？","Did you notice two police cars moving together?\t\t你有没有注意到，有两辆警车一起行动？","Have you ever had an engine stall out?\t\t你有没有遇到过发动机熄火的情况？","When you run into a traffic jam, do you honk your horn?\t\t你遇到堵车时会按喇叭吗？","service the car\t\t保养汽车","watch your speed\t\t关注车速","green light ahead\t\t前方绿灯","There is a rear-end collision ahead!\t\t前面有追尾事故！","engine hard to start\t\t发动机启动困难","engine oil leak\t\t发动机油泄漏","engine maintenance record\t\t发动机维修记录","Only people who have undergone formal training can drive large buses.\t\t只有经过正规训练的人才可以驾驶大巴。","The driver saw an accident ahead and immediately decided to turn around and leave.\t\t司机看到前方有事故，立刻决定掉头离开。","four tires\t\t四个轮胎","She slowed down quickly when she saw the red light, so there was no rear-end collision.\t\t她看到红灯时迅速减速，所以没有追尾。","If you're going to turn at this intersection, don't forget to slow down first.\t\t如果你要在这个路口拐弯，别忘了先减速。","install tires\t\t安装轮胎","quiet tunnel\t\t安静的隧道","steady speed\t\t平稳速度","smooth driving\t\t平稳驾驶","Many people think that honking the horn at night will disturb nearby residents.\t\t很多人认为晚上按喇叭会打扰附近的居民。","We drove through a very long tunnel today.\t\t我们今天开车经过了一个很长的隧道。","We passed through a bright tunnel today.\t\t我们今天经过了一个明亮的隧道。","Because I took the wrong road, I can only make a U-turn at the next intersection.\t\t我因为走错路，只能在下一个路口掉头。","My friend told me that he also heard the sound of a police car.\t\t我朋友告诉我，他也听到了警车的声音。","My friend said if he sees someone speeding, he will call the police immediately.\t\t我朋友说如果他看到有人超速会立即报警。","As soon as my friend saw me stall, they got out and helped me push the car.\t\t我的朋友看到我熄火后，马上下来帮我推车。","control the steering wheel\t\t控制方向盘","control vehicle speed\t\t控制车速","newly built tunnel\t\t新建的隧道","new sports car model\t\t新款跑车","new energy vehicles\t\t新能源汽车","steering wheel button\t\t方向盘按钮","Yesterday I personally witnessed police chasing a car with no license plates.\t\t昨天我亲眼看见警察在追一辆没有车牌的汽车。","check for engine faults\t\t检查发动机故障","check the steering wheel\t\t检查方向盘","blurry license plate\t\t模糊的车牌","monitor vehicle speed\t\t监测车速","the middle of the overpass\t\t立交桥中间","overpass entrance\t\t立交桥入口","interchange exit\t\t立交桥出口","next to the overpass\t\t立交桥旁边","near the overpass\t\t立交桥附近","wait until the light turns green\t\t等到绿灯","red light indicates\t\t红灯指示","go past the overpass\t\t经过立交桥","through the tunnel\t\t经过隧道","stolen license plate\t\t被偷的车牌","record license plate information\t\t记录车牌信息","adjust the steering wheel\t\t调整方向盘","luxury sports car experience\t\t豪华跑车体验","make the green light\t\t赶上绿灯","Traffic is smooth\t\t路况平稳","license plate number clear\t\t车牌号码清晰","changes in vehicle speed\t\t车速变化","speed limit\t\t车速限制","the tire's tread pattern\t\t轮胎的花纹","Is this road passable?\t\t这条路走得走不得？","Can this car be driven or not?\t\t这辆车开得开不得？","encounter a red light\t\t遇到红灯","encounter a green light\t\t遇到绿灯","obey the speed limit\t\t遵守限速要求","Doesn't that driver know they're already speeding?\t\t那位司机不知道自己已经超速了吗？","Don't take that road!\t\t那条路走不得！","Can we go to that area or not?\t\t那片区域去得去不得？","That red sports car was obviously speeding on the highway.\t\t那辆红色跑车明显在公路上超速了。","a long long tunnel\t\t长长的隧道","speed limit zone\t\t限速区域","speed limit sign\t\t限速标志","tunnel exit\t\t隧道出口"]],
  ["News: Share a news story",["a screenshot\t\t一张截图","upload screenshot\t\t上传截图","severe drought\t\t严重干旱现象","number of internet users in China\t\t中国网民数量","neutral spokesperson\t\t中立的发言人","neutral stance\t\t中立的立场","neutral performance\t\t中立表现","They changed the date of the meeting to next week.\t\t他们将会议的日期改到了下周。","infectious disease testing\t\t传染病检测","infectious disease vaccine\t\t传染病疫苗","infectious disease prevention\t\t传染病预防","Have you ever seen a documentary about medical rescue?\t\t你有没有看过关于医疗救援的纪录片？","Could you help me summarize the speaker's main points?\t\t你能帮我概括一下发言人的主要观点吗？","Could you help me set up news alerts?\t\t你能帮我设置新闻推送提醒吗？","Could you summarize the key points of this new service?\t\t你能总结一下这项新服务的要点吗？","Could you summarize the key points of this meeting?\t\t你能概括一下这次会议的重点吗？","public medical institutions\t\t公共医疗机构","recommended by medical authorities\t\t医学权威推荐","health insurance policy\t\t医疗保险政策","medical resources are strained\t\t医疗资源紧张","spokesperson responds\t\t发言人回应","spokesperson's statement\t\t发言人声明","A spokesperson should be honest and should not mislead anyone!\t\t发言人应该诚实，不应该误导任何人！","A spokesperson must ensure that their remarks do not mislead the public.\t\t发言人必须确保自己的发言不会误导公众。","spokesperson responsibilities\t\t发言人职责","send a screenshot\t\t发送截图","The driver suddenly suffered a heart attack, needs an ambulance.\t\t司机突发心脏病，需要救护车。","basic medical equipment\t\t基础医疗设备","She decided to reveal all the details at the press conference.\t\t她决定在记者会上曝光所有细节。","If they roll out new features on time, users will be even more satisfied.\t\t如果他们按时推出新功能，用户会更加满意。","If you expose this information, will there be any risk?\t\t如果你曝光这些信息，会不会有风险？","media hot topics\t\t媒体热点","The school will move the graduation ceremony online.\t\t学校将毕业典礼改为线上。","completely neutral\t\t完全中立","completely neutral point of view\t\t完全中立观点","common infectious diseases\t\t常见传染病","drought response measures\t\t干旱期间应对措施","Many people participated in this march.\t\t很多人参加了这次游行。","Many authoritative media outlets reported on this matter.\t\t很多家权威媒体报道了这件事。","We sent the video to the reporter.\t\t我们将视频发给了记者。","I believe a spokesperson must be honest and must not mislead anyone.\t\t我认为发言人必须诚实，不能误导任何人。","I think there are still many opportunities in sports.\t\t我认为在体育领域还有很多机会。","phone screenshot\t\t手机截图","Nurses and volunteers participated together in the rescue operation.\t\t护士和志愿者一起参与了救援行动。","ongoing drought effects\t\t持续干旱影响","period of prolonged drought\t\t持续干旱时期","The ambulance took the injured to the hospital.\t\t救护车将受伤的人送去了医院。","new hot topic\t\t新的热点","press conference spokesperson\t\t新闻发布会发言人","trending news\t\t新闻热点","news highlights\t\t新闻要点","Yesterday there was a parade downtown.\t\t昨天市中心有一场游行。","Yesterday, Nurse Li Tianmei participated in the rescue mission in the mountainous area.\t\t昨天护士李天美参与了山区的救援任务。","As the spokesperson, Li Tianmei clearly summarizes the key points every time.\t\t李天美作为发言人，每次都能清楚地概括核心观点。","view screenshot\t\t查看截图","The march lasted two hours.\t\t游行持续了两个小时。","During the parade, transportation is somewhat inconvenient.\t\t游行期间交通有些不方便。","relevant screenshots\t\t相关截图","The field of technology has advanced very quickly recently.\t\t科技领域最近发展得非常迅速。","neutral stance\t\t立场中立","The manager asked me to include all the key points in the report.\t\t经理让我把所有关键要点写进报告里。","internet users participate in discussions\t\t网民参与讨论","online users' reviews of the new product\t\t网民对新产品评价","feedback from internet users\t\t网民意见反馈","internet hot topics\t\t网络热点","Reporters hope the spokesperson will provide more details.\t\t记者们希望发言人能提供更多细节。","The reporter uploaded the photos to the internet.\t\t记者将照片上传到了网上。","The reporters said they would send the latest updates right away.\t\t记者说他们会第一时间推送最新进展。","This parade has been approved.\t\t这场游行被批准了。","This company launched a smartwatch yesterday.\t\t这家公司昨天推出了一款智能手表。","This product has received recognition from authorities.\t\t这款产品得到了权威的认可。","facing drought challenges\t\t面临干旱挑战","prevent infectious diseases\t\t预防传染病","There was a sudden car accident on the highway.\t\t高速公路上突发了一场车祸。"]],
  ["Seaside: Describe a scene by the seaside",["a sea turtle\t\t一只海龟","a whale\t\t一条鲸鱼","People ran, people hid, and soon they were nowhere to be seen.\t\t人们跑的跑，躲的躲，很快都不见了。","This winter, the number of polar bears has decreased somewhat because of extreme weather.\t\t今年冬天，北极熊的数量因为极端天气而有所减少。","Do you like that kind of cool and quiet natural environment?\t\t你喜欢那种凉爽又安静的自然环境吗？","Are you still brave enough to go out in the heat?\t\t你在高温天气还敢外出吗？","Have you ever seen a river that is frozen in winter?\t\t你有没有见过冬天结冰的河流？","Did you know dolphins are actually wild animals too?\t\t你知道海豚其实也是野生动物吗？","Do you know how tornadoes form?\t\t你知道龙卷风是怎么形成的吗？","Do you think polar bears can adapt to a rapidly changing environment?\t\t你认为北极熊能适应快速变化的环境吗？","Protecting wild marine life is everyone's responsibility.\t\t保护野生海洋生物是每个人的责任。","Last summer, my friend and I went to a cool valley.\t\t去年夏天，我和朋友一起去了一个凉爽的山谷。","Mediterranean scenery\t\t地中海景色","Mediterranean seawater\t\t地中海的海水","If there is a rainstorm, everyone should avoid going out.\t\t如果出现暴雨，大家应该避免外出。","take shelter indoors from hail\t\t室内躲避冰雹","The trees on the mountain, some big and some small, are all green.\t\t山上的树，大的大，小的小，都是绿色的。","pollen on the mountain\t\t山上的花粉","huge whale\t\t巨大的鲸鱼","young sea turtle\t\t年轻的海龟","Many people choose to stay home to avoid the downpour.\t\t很多人为了躲避暴雨，选择留在家里。","Those of us who work went to work, those of us who go to school went to school, none of us were affected.\t\t我们上班的上班，上学的上学，都没被影响。","My older brother is very interested in wild marine life.\t\t我的哥哥对野生海洋生物非常感兴趣。","collect pollen\t\t收集花粉","Yesterday's downpour prevented many people from getting home.\t\t昨天的暴雨导致很多人无法回家。","pollen on the tree\t\t树上的花粉","There is an open space by the river that is suitable for picnics.\t\t河流旁边有一块适合野餐的空地。","marine species\t\t海洋物种","There are many wild animals in the ocean, and they are very mysterious.\t\t海洋里有很多野生动物，它们很神秘。","whales in the ocean\t\t海洋里的鲸鱼","dolphin calls\t\t海豚的叫声","clear pond\t\t清澈的池塘","clear lake water\t\t清澈的湖水","beautiful sailboat\t\t漂亮的帆船","number of species\t\t物种数量","white ocean waves\t\t白色的海浪","Scientists recommend that older adults go out as little as possible in summer.\t\t科学家建议老人夏天尽量少外出。","rare species\t\t稀有的物种","rare weather phenomenon\t\t罕见的天气现象","rare opportunity\t\t罕见的机会","rare phenomenon\t\t罕见的现象","unusually high temperatures\t\t罕见高温","pollen season\t\t花粉季节","blue sailboat\t\t蓝色帆船","the blue Mediterranean Sea\t\t蓝色的地中海","blue whale\t\t蓝色的鲸鱼","observe hail size\t\t观察冰雹大小","These stones are either too big or too small, none are what I am looking for.\t\t这些石头大的大，小的小，都不是我想要的。","encounter torrential rain\t\t遇到暴雨","facing the heat\t\t面对炎热","pollen from fresh flowers\t\t鲜花的花粉","whale sounds\t\t鲸鱼声音","tornado weather\t\t龙卷风天气"]]
